1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT ==Indecht  ingen Luigheach Meann Dál Fiatach==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Daughter of Luigheach Meann, King of Ulster
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Geneology==
2 CONT
2 CONT According to Foras Feasa ar Éirinn, Caolbhaidh was a son of Cronn Badhraoi, son of Eochaidh Cobha, son of Lughaidh, son of Rossa, son of Iomchaidh, son of Feidhlimidh, son of Cas, son of Fiachaidh Aruidhe, son of Aonghus Gaibhnion
2 CONC n, son of Fearghus Foghlas, son of Tiobraide Tireach, son of Breasal, son of Fearb, son of Mal, son of Rochruidhe, son of Cathbhadh, son of Giallchaidh, son of Cunnchaidh, son of Fionnchaidh, son of Muireadhach, son of Fiachaidh F
2 CONC ionnamhnus, son of Irial Glunmhar, son of Conall Cearnach of the race of Ir son of Milidh.[4] Furthermore, John O'Hart's Irish Genealogies gives the line of descent onwards from Caolbhaidh descendant is his son:-
2 CONT
2 CONT * 92.Feargan: his son
2 CONT * 93.Mongan: his son
2 CONT * 94.Fogartach: his son
2 CONT * 95.Cruinnieth: his son
2 CONT * 96.Artan: his son
2 CONT * 97.Cuinncon: his son
2 CONT * 98.Crum na Cruach: his son
2 CONT * 99.Croncruach: his son
2 CONT * 100.Eochaidh: his son
2 CONT * 101.Searran: his son
2 CONT * 102.Bugmaille: his son
2 CONT * 103.Ciannait: his son
2 CONT * 104.Gillcolum: his son
2 CONT * 105.Donall: his son
2 CONT * 106.Fionnach/Donoch: his son
2 CONT * 107.Shane/John: his son
2 CONT * 108.Tomhas: his son
2 CONT * 109.Tomhas Oge: his son
2 CONT * 110.Searran II: his son
2 CONT * 111.GiollaPadraic: his son
2 CONT * 112.GiollaPadraic Oge: his son
2 CONT * 113.Giolgagin: his son
2 CONT * 114.GiollaCollum: his son
2 CONT * 115.Eachmilidh I: his son
2 CONT * 116.Aodh/Hugh: his son
2 CONT * 117.Torlogh: his son
2 CONT * 118.Phelim: his son
2 CONT * 119.Eachmilidh II: his son
2 CONT * 120.Phelim II: his son
2 CONT * 121.Patrick McCartan: his son
2 CONT * 122.John McCartan:(Left Ireland in the service of King James II) his son
2 CONT * 123.Anthony McCartan: (Followed King James II and became a Captain in the French Brigade in France) his son
2 CONT * 124.Antoine McCartan: (A Physician) his son
2 CONT * 125.Andronicus McCartan: (A Medical Doctor) his son
2 CONT * 126.Felix McCartan of Lille.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Source''' Wikipedia Cáelbad - https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cáelbad
2 CONT
