2 CONT * 117.Torlogh: his son
2 CONT * 118.Phelim: his son
2 CONT * 119.Eachmilidh II: his son
2 CONT * 120.Phelim II: his son
2 CONT * 121.Patrick McCartan: his son
2 CONT * 122.John McCartan:(Left Ireland in the service of King James II) his son
2 CONT * 123.Anthony McCartan: (Followed King James II and became a Captain in the French Brigade in France) his son
2 CONT * 124.Antoine McCartan: (A Physician) his son
