1 NAME Flann Sinna mac Mael Sechnall, High King of Ireland
1 SEX M
1 BURI
2 PLAC Clonmacnoise Cemetery
2 ADDR
3 CITY Clonmacnoise
3 CTRY Ireland
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 847
2 ADDR
