2 CONT *https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/%C3%9Alfur_skj%C3%A1lgi_H%C3%B6gnason
2 CONT
2 CONT == Geni notes
2 CONT Hermann Pálsson and Paul Edwards in their 1972 translation of Landnámabók (titled [https://uofmpress.ca/books/detail/the-book-of-settlements The Book of Settlements]) called this man [https://books.google.com.au/books?id=jj6cIwMCZ
2 CONC qIC&q=jorund+atlason#v=snippet&q=jorund%20atlason&f=false "Jorund Atlason"].
