2 CONC ,] BRIAN Boroma, son of [https://www.geni.com/people/Cennetig-Mac-Lorcain-King-of-the-Dal-Gcais/6000000002043192241?through=6000000002043263223 CEINNÉITIG] & his wife --- (941-killed in battle Clontarf 23 Apr 1014).  m thirdly ([s
