2 CONT Name: Donnchad mac Gillai Pátraic Sex: M Birth: in rí Osraige & Laigin d'urmhór Death: 1039 Reference Number: 25375 Note: Donnchad mac Gillai Pátraic, rí Osraige & Laigin d'urmhór was the son of Gilla Pátraic mac Donnchada, tigher
2 CONC na Osraighe and Máelmare Haraldsdottir of Dublin.1,2,3 Also called Donnchad mac Gilli Pátric.4 King of Osraige in Ossory, Leinster, Ireland, between 1003 and 1039.5 Annals of Ulster 1016: "''Donn Cuan son of Dúlang, king of Laigin
2 CONC , and Tadc ua Riain, king of Uí Drona, were slain by Donnchad, son of Gilla Pátraic, in the middle of Leithglenn. / Donn Cuan m. Dunluing,ri Laighen, & Tadhg H. Rian, rí H. n-Drona, do marbad la Donnchad m. Gilla Patraicc for lar 
2 CONC Leithghlinne."6 King of Laigin in Leinster, Ireland, between 1033 and 1039.5 Annals of the Four Masters 1039: "Donnchadh mac Giolla Phátraicc, tigherna Osraighe & Laighen d'urmhór, d'écc iar m-beith i n-galar fhotta." (Donnchadh M
2 CONC ac Gillaphadraig, lord of Osraighe and of the greater part of Leinster, died after long illness.).2 He died in 1039.2 
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Donnchad mac Gillai Pátraic, rí Osraige & Laigin d'urmhór:  Gilla Pátraic mac Donnchada, rí Osraige+ d. 1055 
2 CONT
