1 NAME Gormflaith ingen Murchada /O'Faelain/
2 GIVN Gormflaith ingen Murchada
2 SURN O'Faelain
2 _MARNM O'Faelain
2 NICK Gormflaeth (Gormlaith) ingen Murchada formerly Murchadh
1 SEX F
