2 CONT c) [ARNFINN Torfinnsson (-murdered Murkle, Caithness <nowiki>----</nowiki>). Orkneyinga Saga names (in order) “Arnfinn…Havard the Fecund…Hlodvir…Ljot…Skuli” as the five sons of Thorfinn[206]. Snorre names "the Earls Hlodver, Arnfi
