2 CONC n "Hausakljufer"[208]. He succeeded his father in [976] as Jarl of Orkney [and Caithness]. Orkneyinga Saga records that “Ragnhild Eirik´s daughter plotted the death of her husband Arnfinn at Murkle in Caithness” before marrying “h
2 CONC is brother Havard the Fecund who succeeded to the earldom”[209].
