2 CONC ver, Liot and Skule" as sons of Thorfin "Hausakljufer"[215]. He succeeded his brother as Jarl of Orkney. Orkneyinga Saga records that Havard was killed by his “nephew…Einar Buttered-Bread” at “Stenness on Mainland”[216].
