2 CONC 00079501493237?through=6000000002043186310 Conchobhar] son of Maeleachlainn king of Teamhair”[620].'''  It is assumed that Maelsechnaill separated from Gormlaith as he is recorded with another wife before Gormlaith died.  m firstl
