2 CONT      Of Uí Muiredaig branch of Uí Dúnlaing. Also called Máelcorcre ingen Dúnlaing. Máelcorcre Ó Toole was born before 1014.1 She was the daughter of rí Laigin Dúnlang mac Tuathail Uí Muiredaig and unknown (?).1,3 Máelcorcre Ó Tool
2 CONC e married Amlaíb mac Sitric, rí Gall, son of Sitric mac Amlaíb, rí Gall and Slani ingen Briain Dál gCais, before 1031.1
