2 CONT      Also called Ragnhilda Ólafsdóttir.5,6 Radnaillt of Dublin was born in 1025.6 She was born circa 1031 at Dublin, Ireland.7 She was the daughter of Amlaíb mac Sitric, rí Gall and Máelcorcre Ó Toole.3,4,2 Radnaillt of Dublin mar
2 CONC ried Cynan ab Iago, Prince of Gwynedd, son of Brenin Gwynedd Iago ab Idwal o Gwynedd and Afandreg verch Gwair of Wales, before 1055.5,6,1
