2 CONT # Name: OLAF Sihtricson King Of Dublin
2 CONT
2 CONT # Given Name: OLAF Sihtricson
2 CONT
2 CONT # Surname: King Of Dublin
2 CONT
2 CONT # Sex: M
2 CONT
2 CONT # Birth: 994-1000 in Dublin, Ireland
2 CONT
2 CONT # Death: 1034-1091 in Route to Rome on a pilgrimage
2 CONT
2 CONT # Change Date: 21 Sep 2005 at 15:23
2 CONT
2 CONT Sometime in the 10th century, Olaf Sihtricson, the Danish king of Dublin and Northumbria, and known in sagas as Olaf the Red, was born (d. c. 981).
2 CONT
2 CONT Olaf Sihtricson, known in sagas as Olaf the Red (died c. 981), Danish King of Northumbria (940-944, 949-952) and King of Dublin (944-949, 952-980)
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: SIHTRIC "Silken Beard" Olafsson King Of Dublin b: 964 in Dublin, Ireland
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother: SLANI of Ireland b: 983 in of Munster, Ireland
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage 1 Maelcorcre of Leinster Dlnlaing O'muiredaig b: Abt 1000 in Leinster, Ireland
2 CONT
