2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Úlfrún (Bardarssdottir) Bárðardóttir, Snorri (Bardarsson) Bárðarson, Aron (Bårdursen) Baardsson, Rognvald Bardarsson, Atli Baardsson, Sveinbjörn (Bardarson) Bárðarson, Ingolf Baardsson, Gunnar Bardarsson, Hoskuld Bardars
2 CONC son, Markus Bardarsson, Halbera Baardarsdottir, Oddgeir Bardarsdottir and Salgard Bardarssdottir Died 1140 in Selardalur Vesturbardastran, Iceland.
