2 CONC oc_id=6000000173393115944 [Bartrum charts him as a Gen 1 man married to a Gen 3 woman, which is not feasible. He then charts "great grandson" Caradog's father and grandfather as Gen 2 men, meaning they were born before the Gen 3 E
