1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Jartrud Jonsdatter Bjarkøy==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Jartrud Jonsdotter Giske, daughter of Jon Arnesson Giske and Ranveig Sigurdsdotter at Bjarkøy, was born in 1080 in Bjarkøy, Troms, Norway. Research notes: B8y Jartrud married Viljalm Runners of squares [MRIN: 512] 212
2 CONT
2 CONT * With Aud, Sigurd had  her daughter, Ragnhild Sigurdsdatter , strategically married to Jon Arnesson from Giske , son of Arne Arnesson , and descended from Erling Skjalgsson at Sola and Astrid Tryggvesdatter , sister of Olav Trygg
2 CONC vason . Ragnhild and Jon got the son Vidkun Jonsson from Bjarkøy, which is mentioned several times in the royal sagas.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Snorre Sturlasson also mentions that Ragnhild and Jon had children==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Sigurd Hund 
2 CONT * Erling Jonsson 
2 CONT * Jartrud Jonsdatter .
2 CONT
2 CONT ———————
2 CONT
2 CONT Snorre Sturlasson nevner i tillegg at Ragnhild og Jon fikk barna Sigurd Hund, Erling Jonsson og Jartrud Jonsdatter
2 CONT
