2 CONT Ancestor of the Barons of Kerry and Lixnaw, the Earls of Kerry, Earls of Shelburne, and Marquesses of Lansdowne [Burkes´s Peerage II, p. 1678].  The Red Book of the Exchequer, listing scutage payments in [1194/95], names "Robertus
