2 CONT Hugh de Montgomery formerly Montgomerie Born 1120 in Innerwick, Renfrewshire, Scotland ANCESTORS  Son of Philip (Montgomerie) Montgomery and Margaret Dunbar Brother of Robert Montgomery [spouse(s) unknown] [children unknown] Died 
2 CONC [date unknown] [location unknown] Profile manager: Pat Credit  Profile last modified 26 Apr 2020  Created 11 Jun 2017 Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Hugh (Montgomerie) de Montgomery is a member of Clan Montgomery. Hugh is the second son of Philip Demontgomerie and Lady Margaret Dunbar. Hugh resided in Boudjesworth. He married Elizabeth, daughter of Adam De Gordon. Hugh and Eli
2 CONC zabeth had two children: Adam and Equida or Giles. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Research Notes Philip DeMontgomerie, father of Hugh. Hugh was born 1120 in Innerwick, Renfrewshire, , Scotland
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources Montgomery: Page 42 II. Hugh de Montgomerie of Boudjesworth See also:
