2 CONC ney and Caithness.  He granted ½ Orkney in 1139 to Harald Maddadsson.  Leaving Harald in charge of Orkney, he sailed for Palestine in 1151, returning in Dec 1155.  He was murdered by Thorbiorn Clerk.  Orkneyinga Saga records that 
