1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===MASTER WILLIAM OF MONTGOMERY (aka MAGRO WILLO DE MUNGUMERIE)===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''The ancestry of Master William of Montgomery cannot be satisfactorily identified from authentic records. His name is noticed in the witness list of a charter by which Helias, brother of Jocelin, bishop of Glasgow, confirms that
2 CONC  he has given the church of Dunsyre to the monks of Kelso. The charter is undated but it was issued during Jocelin's  time as bishop of Glasgow,1174-99. [https://archive.org/details/libersmariedecal01kels/page/285 Kelso: charter 3
2 CONC 56 on p. 285]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===PUBLISHED SOURCES===
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://archive.org/details/libersmariedecal01kels/page/n10 Liber S, Marie de Calchou. Registrum Cartarum Abbacie Tironensis de Kelso. 1113-1567. (Bannatyne Club, Edinburgh, MDCCCXLVI), 582 pp. including indexes]
2 CONT
2 CONT ===PUBLISHED GENEALOGY===
2 CONT
2 CONT # [https://archive.org/details/memorialsofmonv100fras/page/n8 Memorials of the Montgomeries Earls of Eglinton. By William Fraser. Volume I. (Edinburgh, MDCCCLIX), 400 pp. including illustrations]
