1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===HUGH OF MONTGOMERY===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''The ancestry of Hugh of Montgomery has not been satisfactorily identified. His name is first noticed in MacFarlane's Genealogical Collections, where he is said to have had a daughter named Egidia who married Shaw, second son of
2 CONC  Duncan Macduff, third earl of Fife, the first of the Mackintoshes. [https://archive.org/details/genealogicalcol01clargoog/page/n174 MacFarlane I: p. 158] B. G. de Montgomery, who cites MacFarlane, identified him as a son of Rober
2 CONC t of Montgomery but upon what evidence he does not say. [https://www.slideshare.net/HalcyonKing/origin-and-history-of-the-montgomerys History of the Montgomerys: p. 102] For want of authentic evidence, presumably, Hugh of Montgome
2 CONC ry is not mentioned in the account of the family that the Reverend John Anderson produced for the Scots Peerage. [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun03paul/page/423 The Scots Peerage III: 423]'''
2 CONT
