2 CONT Theatrical representations
2 CONT
2 CONT In the play The Dreaming of the Bones by W. B. Yeats, the ghosts of Dermot and Derbforgaill rescue an Irish freedom fighter during the Easter Week rebellion, and reveal that they are bound until an Irishman can forgive them for br
2 CONC inging the Normans to Ireland.[8]
