2 CONT
2 CONT 6.    Diarmait MacMurchada, b. 1100, King of Leinster 1135, d. 1 Jan. 1171.  He had several wives, of whom Mor, dau. of Muirchertach Ua Tuathail (O'Toole) was the mother of his dau. Aoife.  Mor d. 1164.
2 CONT
