1 NAME Susanna /verch Gruffydd/
2 GIVN Susanna
2 SURN verch Gruffydd
2 _MARNM verch Gruffydd
2 NICK Sisana ferch Griffith
2 NICK Siwsanna ferch Ruvydd
2 NICK Susan ferch Gruffydd
2 NICK verch Gruffudd
1 SEX F
1 BURI
