2 CONT    Young: Susanna of Gwynedd.
2 CONT                    *******   Roots: Note error in Dict. of Welsh Biog. which shows Susanna as daughter of Owen Gryffydd. Correct father shown in Dictionary of National Biography.
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES:  1.  Ancestral File gives her name as Susanna.  Other sources do not identify
2 CONT       her by name.
