2 CONC --- (-[1205/06]).  His parentage is confirmed by the charter dated 7 Oct 1234 which records payment of a fine by his son "Richard de Burgh" for return of land in Connaught which had been confiscated from him "the strife with Huber
2 CONC t de Burgh Earl of Kent his uncle"[467].  Lord of Connaught. m ---.  The name of William´s wife is not known …”.)
