2 CONT Son of William de BURGH Lord of Connaught (-1205) and dau. of Donnell O'BRIEN 
2 CONT
2 CONT BIOGRAPHY:     d. 1242
2 CONT
2 CONT BIOGRAPHY: Married Egidia de LACY (1200-) 
2 CONT
2 CONT BIOGRAPHY: Children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT BIOGRAPHY: Walter de BURGH 2nd Earl of Ulster (1230-1271) m. Avelina FitzJohn (1238-1274) 
