2 CONT Ragnhild (?)||p14698.htm#i146971|Olaf, King of Man and the Isles||p14698.htm#i146972||||||||||||||||
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=14 May 2005
2 CONT
2 CONT      Ragnhild (?) is the daughter of Olaf, King of Man and the Isles.1 She married Somerled, Thane of Argyll in 1140.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Ragnhild (?) and Somerled, Thane of Argyll
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Angus, Lord of Bute and Arran+ d. 12101
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Ranald, Lord of the Isles+ d. 12071
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Dougal (?) 1
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Gillicallum (?) d. 11641
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Olav (?) 1
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Gall Macsgillin (?) 1
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Beatrix (?) 1
