2 CONT
2 CONT Ragnhild Olafsdatter. Parents: King Olaf Godfredson and Ingeborg Haakonsdatter.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: King Somerled II Of Morven. King Somerled II Of Morven and Ragnhild Olafsdatter were married in 1140. Children were: King Reignald Somerledsson.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.geocities.com/Heartland/Cliffs/6930/b195.htm#P6272   
2 CONT
2 CONT Olaf's first wife was Aufrica of Galloway, who bore herself and him a son and successor, Godred Olafsson.
2 CONT
2 CONT His second wife was Ingeborg Haakonsdottir, daughter of Haakon, Earl of the Orkneys. This marriage produced at least daughter Ragnhild, who married Somerled, King of Kintyre and the Isles.
2 CONT
2 CONT Reginald, Lagmann and Harald are mentioned as his other sons.
2 CONT
2 CONT After half a century of reign, Olaf I was killed.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Ragnhilda Olavsdottir was the Princess of Mann, daughter (and only known child) of King Olav of the Isle of Man.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT See "My Lines"
2 CONT
2 CONT ( http://homepages.rootsweb.ancestry.com/~cousin/html/p58.htm#i7026 )
2 CONT
2 CONT from Compiler: R. B. Stewart, Evans, GA
2 CONT
2 CONT ( http://homepages.rootsweb.ancestry.com/~cousin/html/index.htm )
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Det antas att Harald Svartes son Gudröd Crovan äktade Ragnhild, dotter till Harald Hårdråde. Detta bekräftas vid att ett av Gudröd Crovans barnbarn (dotter av Olof Bitling) blev kallad Ragnhild; hon blev gift med Somerled av Argyl
2 CONC l. (Fra Skanke-slektens historie, G.V.C. Young, 1986, sid 10) och (Fra Skanke-släktens historia, G.V.C. Young, stamtavla 1a) och (Chronicle of Man and the Sudreys, doc 56 och 57) är två appendix som visar Somerleds genealogi.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.espell.se/saga/p25109a0c.html
