2 CONC y, by Annora. He died shortly before 26 December1242 and was buried in the convent of the Franciscan Friars atCarrickfergus. Emeline, who had no issue by Hugh, married, between 8February 1242/3 and 14 December 1244, Stephen LONGES
2 CONC PEE, sometimeSeneschal of Gascony and Justiciar of Ireland, who died before her. Shewas living, 18 May 1275, and died shortly before 19 July 1276.  [CompletePeerage XII/2:168-71, (transcribed by Dave Utzinger)]
