2 CONT      Thomas FitzMaurice, Baron Kerry & Lixnaw married Grania MacMorrogh, daughter of Conchobar MacMurrough.2 Thomas FitzMaurice, Baron Kerry & Lixnaw was born circa 1220. He died on 29 June 1280 at Bruree, Limerick, Ireland.
