1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == SIR JOHN OF MONTGOMERY ==
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sir John of Montgomery, here treated, is the son of Alan of Montgomery. He and his father are noticed in the witness list of a undated charter by which Vincent son of Robert Avenel confirms that he has given part of the territo
2 CONC ry of Innerwick to the monks of Kelso.[https://archive.org/details/libersmariedecal01kels/page/210 Kelso Liber: charter number 252 on pp. 210-11]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Marriage ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sir John of Montgomery, here treated, married Helena, one of the heirs of Robert of Kent: "Johs de Mundegumi 7 Helena uxor eis / hedes Rob de Kent". [https://archive.org/details/libersmariedecal01kels/page/209 Kelso Liber: char
2 CONC ter number 251 on pp. 209-10]'''
