2 CONT
2 CONT * '''William De CAREW, Born: BEF 1228 & Died: 1279'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Notes: possibly the William who had a serjeanty of co. Waterford in 1277.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * Father: Nicholas De CAREW of Carew Castle
2 CONT * Mother: Catherine De COURCYE
2 CONT
