2 CONT
2 CONT Son of Archibald Gillespic Campbell of Lochow and Finval Fraser. Also known as Dubhghall Caimbeul of Lochawe, Knight, Lord of Lochawe, and Seventh Knight of Lochowe. Married first Anna MacDonald. Married second Finlay MacGillivrai
2 CONC l, also known as Findoig mac Gillivrail, and Finval. Father of Dugald Campbell, Second Lord of Craignish, Sir Archibald Campbell of Lochawe, Duncan "Dubh" Campbell of Strachur, and Hugh Campbell.
