2 CONT *Mother     Hodierna de Gernon d. 1219
2 CONT *''''''     Margery de Burgh married Theobald le Boteler, son of Theobald le Botiller (Butler) and Joan de Marais, before 1242.2 Margery de Burgh died after 1 March 1253.
