2 CONT *''''''     Margery de Burgh was the daughter of Richard de Burgh.1 She married Theobald Butler, son of Theobald le Botiller and Joan du Marais, before 1242.1 She died after 1 March 1252/53.1
2 CONT *''''''      From before 1242, her married name became Butler.1 On 27 April 1250 she made a fine to remarry.1
