1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Harald Eiríksson''' (fl. 1190s), also known as Harald the Young, was joint Earl of Orkney with Harald Maddadsson. He was the son of Orkney chief Eirik Stagbrell and Ingerid Ragnvaldsdotter, the daughter of Rögnv
2 CONC ald Kali Kolsson, the former Earl of Orkney.
2 CONT
2 CONT == Family ==
2 CONT
2 CONT >>>>[http://www.geni.com/people/Ingirid-R%C3%B6gnvaldsd%C3%B3ttir/6000000003820968980 INGIGERD].  Orkneyinga Saga records the marriage of “Earl Rognvald…his daughter Ingerid” and “[http://www.geni.com/people/Eric-Slagbrellir/60000
2 CONC 00003820968990?through=6000000003820968980 Eirik Stay-Brails]”[917].
2 CONT
