2 CONT Shrivenham Manor
2 CONT The service from the manor was settled in 1231 on William Marshal the younger, Earl of Pembroke, and his wife Eleanor, the king's sister (Cal. Chart. R. 1226–57, p. 102; Cal. Close, 1227–31, p. 518).
2 CONT
