1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT "Isabel Marshal (9 October 1200 – 17 January 1240) was a medieval English countess. She was the wife of both Gilbert de Clare, 4th Earl of Hertford and 1st Earl of Gloucester and Richard, 1st Earl of Cornwall (son of King John of 
2 CONC England). With the former, she was a great grandparent of King Robert the Bruce of Scotland."
2 CONT
