1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Parentage undocumented and uncertain. Assigned to "Sir Walter de White" for want of a better place to put him.
2 CONT
2 CONT Here's a conundrum for you: if his home base was Martock, Somerset, how could he have sons in Yorkshire? (He didn't.)
