2 CONT **3. Paul, Sir James (1909). The Scots Peerage. Edinburgh: David Douglas. Vol Vll, 1910. "The Ancient Earls of Ross" [https://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefoun07paul#page/234/mode/2up page 234-235]
2 CONT * http://www.clanmacfarlanegenealogy.info/genealogy/TNGWebsite/getperson.php?personID=I4354&tree=CC
