2 CONT      Llywelyn ap Iorwerth, Prince of North Wales was also known as Llewelyn, Prince of Wales.3 Llywelyn ap Iorwerth, Prince of North Wales also went by the nick-name of Llwelyn 'the Great'. He gained the title of Prince Llywelyn o
2 CONC f North Wales.4 He hanged the Anglo-Norman baron, William de la Braose, for having an affair with his wife.
