2 CONC en as Tangwystl ferch Llywarch Goch. Please also see Medlands: Wales; https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/WALES.htm#Gwladusdied1251, which give the mother of Gwladus Ddu as "Mistress (1) or (2)", with (1) being the aforementioned Tan
