2 CONT     Gruffydd (Fawr) ap Llywelyn
2 CONT
2 CONT Gruffydd, known as Fawr, was born in 1207 in Gwynedd, Caernarvonshire, Wales.
2 CONT
2 CONT He died  due to Fall from the Tower of London at the age of 36 on March 1st, 1243 in London, Middlesex.
