2 CONT BIOGRAPHY: Acceded: 1200, Rhiwabon, Denbigh.
2 CONT
2 CONT BIOGRAPHY: Built Cistercian Abbey of Llanegwest de Valle Crucis in the vale of Llangollen.
2 CONT
2 CONT BIOGRAPHY: Prince of Upper Powys.
2 CONT
2 CONT BIOGRAPHY: Staunchly allied with Llywelyn Fawr.
2 CONT
2 CONT BIOGRAPHY: Aft May 1211 Allied with John against Llywelyn Fawr aft John's victory was inevitable.
2 CONT
2 CONT BIOGRAPHY: 1212 - Only major Welsh Prince to refuse Llywelyn Fawr's alliance vs. John.  
