1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Note:''' Haugsnes is in the low peninsula south of Flugumýri. At Haugsnes the most destructive battle in Icelandic history took place in April 1246. There the Sturlungar fought the Ásbirningar. About 110 men fel
