1 OCCU 2nd Chief of the Clan MacDougall: Duncan de Ergadia (Argyll). Duncan and his son, Ewen, built castles to defend their dominion. Duncan also built Ardchattan Priory, where the MacDonald chiefs were buried until 1737.
