1 OCCU Konge av North Kintyre, Bute and Isles, founder of Clan Ruidhri, Ruler over North Kintyre, Lord i Kintyre, Skottland i början av 1200-talet., He inherited North Kintyre, Bute and Gamoran. His descendants were Clan Ruari of Gamoran
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [https://www.geni.com/people/Ragnall-mac-Somhairle-Lord-of-the-Isles/6000000001745043401?through=6000000002043212109 REGINALD], son of SOMERLED Lord of Argyll & his wife --- of Man (-after 1192).  The Chronicon Man
