2 CONC roner], visited Apr. 17, 2014.
2 CONT * [http://clangunn.weebly.com/why-gunns-are-not-of-norse--orkney-descent.html Why Gunns are not of Norse / Orkney Islands descent], visited Apr. 17, 2014.
