2 CONT
2 CONT Parents Bård Sveinsson på Aksnes  ? ?  Marriages and children Married to Karlshode Bårdsson Nordheim, with  Josef Karlshovedsson  Erlend Karlshodesson  Bård Karlshodesson  Sources:  - person: Galtungslekten 1974 s 12 - family: Gal
