1 NOTE {geni:about_me} There are two Phillips, one is an original Invader in 1169 1170, the next one is born circa 1200 to Gilbert MacOisdealbh, the original MacCostelloe, who was older brother to Phillip 1.
2 CONT
2 CONT Phillip 2 had dusghter Honora and son Miles.
2 CONT Honora married  the O Reilly, and MIles married De Lacys daughter,  Eleanor, who was cousin of the Burkes, Earl of Ulster.
2 CONT THe dower for  Eleanor was Slieve Lugha, the start/first land owned  in the Costello Barony in Mayo.
2 CONT
2 CONT Miles daughter Penelope marries Aed ONeil, her daughter Penelope marries  Gilla Iosa OReilly, who built Cavan Monastery 1300.
2 CONT
2 CONT So De Lacys, Burkes,, ONeils and OReillys were all connected thru the MacCostelloes.
