1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ====Medlands (20 June 2024): [http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/ENGLISH%20NOBILITY%20MEDIEVAL1.htm#_Toc57456160 England, Earls 1138-1142]
2 CONT * 1. '''JOHN''' (Marlow, Buckinghamshire 31 Jan 1232-Marlow, Buckinghamshire 22/23 Sep 1232, bur Reading Abbey).  The ''Annals of Tewkesbury'' record the birth “II Kal Feb” in 1231 of “''Ricardo comiti Cornubiæ filius…Johannes''”,
2 CONC  and in a later passage his death “''apud Merlawe X Kal Oct''” in 1232 and burial “''apud Radinges''”[264].  The ''Annals of Dunstable'' record that “''Johannes filius Ricardi comitis Cornubiæ''” was born and died in 1232[265]
