2 CONT ==================================================================================
2 CONT
2 CONT "Richard de Clare, 5th Earl of Hertford, 6th Earl of Gloucester (4 August 1222 – 14 July 1262) was son of Gilbert de Clare, 4th Earl of Hertford and Isabel Marshal. 
2 CONT On his father's death, when he became Earl of Gloucester (October 1230), he was entrusted first to the guardianship of Hubert de Burgh. On Hubert's fall, his guardianship was given to Peter des Roches (c. October 1232); and in 123
2 CONC 5 to Gilbert, Earl Marshall."
2 CONT
2 CONT ==================================================================================
