2 CONT
2 CONT Joan was the daughter of William de Ferrieres, 5th Earl of Derby and Sibyl Marshal, daughter of William Marshal, 4th Earl of Pembroke and Isabel de Clare.
2 CONT Joan first married Sir John I de Mohun of Dunster, son of Reynold (Reginald) II de Mohun Lord of Dunster and Hawise or Avice Fitzgeoffrey.
2 CONT Joan also married Sir Robert de Aguillon of Watton & Perching, son of Sir Robert de Aguillon of Watton & Addington and Margaret (Margery).
