1 NAME Eva de Braose, Lady Abergavenny
1 SEX F
1 BURI
2 PLAC St. Mary's Priory Church
2 ADDR
3 CITY Abergavenny
3 STAE Wales
3 CTRY United Kingdom
1 BIRT
