2 CONT -----------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Nicholas FitzMaurice, 2nd Lord Kerry & Lixnaw1,2,3 M, #32805, d. 1332 Father	Maurice FitzThomas FitzMaurice, 1st Baron of Kerry & Lixnaw d. 1305 Mother	Elena FitzElie
2 CONT      Nicholas FitzMaurice, 2nd Lord Kerry & Lixnaw was born at of Kerry & Lixnaw, Ireland. He married Slany O'Brien, daughter of Connor O'Brien, Prince of Thomond. Nicholas FitzMaurice, 2nd Lord Kerry & Lixnaw died in 1332. Family
2 CONC  	Slany O'Brien Children	
2 CONT
2 CONT     Maurice FitzNicholas, 3rd Baron Kerry & Lixnaw d. Oct 1339
2 CONT     Sir John FitzNicholas, 4th Baron Kerry & Lixnaw+ d. c 1378
2 CONT     Aveline FitzMaurice+2,3 d. a 14 Mar 1359
2 CONT
2 CONT Citations
2 CONT
