2 CONT Shaw Macintosh Sr. aka 4th of Mackintosh Born 1202 in Moray Scotlandmap Son of William Macintosh and Beatrix (Learmouth) Macintosh Husband of Helen (Williams) Macintosh — married 1220 in Isle of Skye, Scotlandmap Father of Farquha
2 CONC r MacKintosh and	Shaw Macintosh Jr. Died 1265 in Rothiemurcus, Scotlandmap Profile managers: Darrell Parker private message [send private message] and Beth Babcock private message [send private message] Macintosh-87 created 7 Nov 
2 CONC 2013 | Last modified 4 Jun 2015 This page has been accessed 647 times.
2 CONT
2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Shaw Mackintosh, 4th of Mackintosh was the son of William Mackintosh.2 He died in 1265. In 1236 he obtained a lease of Rothiemurchus in Strathspey but not the feu-right till 1464.1 He acquired Meikle Geddes and the castle of Rait.
2 CONC  Child of Shaw Mackintosh, 4th of Mackintosh
2 CONT
2 CONT Ferquhard Mackintosh, 5th of Mackintosh+2 d. 1265 Father of Farquhar Macintosh & Shaw Jr.. Married twice. Possibly more children born but unable to find any records of this. He was born about 1202 and died about 1265. Sources
2 CONT
