1 OCCU Lord Dudley, (Lord) Roger, Lord of Dudley and Dunas
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Alt Birth Year: 1200, 1201, 1205, 1230
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Baron Roger Dudley de Somery - was born about 1208, lived in Dinas Powls, Wales and died before 26 Aug 1273 in Staffordshire, England . He was the son of Ralph de Somery and Margaret Fitzgilbert.
2 CONT
2 CONT Baron Roger married Nicole d'Albiny about 1225 in Sussex, England. Nicole was born about 1210 in Arundel, Sussex, England. She was the daughter of William d'Albiny and Mabel de Meschines. She died in 1240 in Dudley Castle, Staffor
2 CONC dshire, England .
2 CONT
2 CONT   Then Baron Roger married Lady Annabilia Chaucombe about 1228 while living in Dudley, Worcester, England. Lady Annabilia was born about 1225, lived in Chacomb, Northamptonshire, England. She died after 1281 .
2 CONT
2 CONT Baron Roger - There are various guesses as to the real Roger De Somery. This is the most likely, but he was only 11 when his daughter was born.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children with Nicole d'Albiny (Quick Family Chart)
2 CONT
2 CONT i. 	Roger de Somery was born on 24 Jun 1255 and died on 11 Oct 1291 . See #6. below.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. 	Margaret de Somery was born about 1229 in Dudley, Worcestershire, England and died on 18 Jun 1293 .
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret married Ralph Bassett about 1245 in Daudley, Worcestershire, England. Ralph was born in 1215 in Drayton, Staffordshire, England. He was the son of Ralph Bassett. He died on 4 Aug 1265 in Evesham, Worcestershire, England (
2 CONC slain) .
2 CONT
2 CONT See de Centville family for children.
2 CONT
2 CONT iii. 	Joan de Somery was born about 1232, lived in Ellesmere, Shropshire, England and died in 1282 in Knockin, Warwick, England .
2 CONT
2 CONT Joan married John Le Strange. John was born about 1226, lived in Cheswardine, Shropshire, England. He was the son of John Le Strange and Lucy de Tregoz. He died in 1276 in Knockin, Warwick, England . 
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Roger de Somery1 
2 CONT
2 CONT M, #23521
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=22 Dec 2008
2 CONT
2 CONT      Roger de Somery married Nicole d'Aubigny, daughter of William d'Aubigny, 3rd Earl of Arundel and Mabel of Chester.1
2 CONT
2 CONT      Roger de Somery lived at Dudley, Worcestershire, England.2
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Roger de Somery and Nicole d'Aubigny
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret de Somery+ 2 
2 CONT
2 CONT Citations
2 CONT
2 CONT [S6] G.E. Cokayne; with Vicary Gibbs, H.A. Doubleday, Geoffrey H. White, Duncan Warrand and Lord Howard de Walden, editors, The Complete Peerage of England, Scotland, Ireland, Great Britain and the United Kingdom, Extant, Extinct 
2 CONC or Dormant, new ed., 13 volumes in 14 (1910-1959; reprint in 6 volumes, Gloucester, U.K.: Alan Sutton Publishing, 2000), volume I, page 237. Hereinafter cited as The Complete Peerage. 
2 CONT
2 CONT [S6] Cokayne, and others, The Complete Peerage, volume II, page 1. 
2 CONT
