2 CONC al dispensation for the marriage of "Edwardi de Brux comitis de Catrilz" and "Ysabellis nate…Gulielmi comitis de Ros", issued by Pope John XXII, is dated 1 Jun 1317[1064].  http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/SCOTLAND.htm#RobertIdied1
