2 CONC neration. He also charts back to Bleddyn ap Cynfyn, but a review of Bleddyn ap Cynfyn 46; https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000173377939948 shows a Rhiwallon dated the same as his father. That Rhiwallon should be conn
2 CONC ected to a cousin line to Cadwgan of Nannau, from Gwrydr Goch, of Rhos. (Steven Ferry, April 18, 2023.)
