2 CONC  of this Dafydd Goch: c.1225 https://www.geni.com/people/Gruffudd-ap-Dafydd-Goch/6000000061384257951. There was indeed a brother named Gruffudd ap Ednywain that Bartrum conflated with his nephew. That man is c.1190 https://www.gen
2 CONC i.com/people/Gruffudd-ab-Ednywain/6000000061384554946?through=6000000003299328328. In all, there were 4 men named Dafydd Goch in this family, three of them having sons named Ieuan, while two of those men named Ieuan starting same 
2 CONC name strings of Gruffudd ap Ieuan ap Maredudd ap Rhys ap Ieuan.] (Steven Ferry, January 19, 2026.)
