1 OCCU Councilor & General of Prince Llewelyn ap Iorwerth, Seneschal of the Kingdom of Gwynedd, Krigeth in Efinoydd, Chief Counsellor, Chief Justice, Prince of North Wales, Warrior, seneschal
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT Ednyfed Fychan (c. 1170 – 1246), full name Ednyfed Fychan ap Cynwrig,
2 CONT
2 CONT  was a Welsh warrior who became Seneschal to the Kingdom of Gwynedd in Northern Wales, serving Llywelyn the Great and his son Dafydd ap Llywelyn. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Ednyfed claimed descent from Marchudd ap Cynan, Lord of Rhos, 'protector' of Rhodri Mawr, King of Gwynedd.  
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the patrilineal 
2 CONT
2 CONT Ancestor of Owen Tudor and thereby of the Tudor dynasty
2 CONT
2 CONT https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ednyfed_Fychan
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
