2 CONT
2 CONT Senena verch Caradog   
2 CONT
2 CONT Senena was born in 1201 in Angelsey, Wales.1   Senena's father was Caradog and her mother was <Unknown>. She had a brother named Einion.  She was the younger of the two children.  She died at the age of 61 in 1262.1 
2 CONT
2 CONT Personal Details
2 CONT
2 CONT  Gruffydd ap Llywelyn
2 CONT
2 CONT Gruffydd was born in 1207 in Gwynedd, Caernarvonshire, Wales.1 
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth Notes
2 CONT
2 CONT He died  due to Fell from the Tower of London at the age of 36 on March 1st, 1243 in London, Middlesex.1 
2 CONT
2 CONT Death Notes
2 CONT
2 CONT  Senena verch Caradog
2 CONT
2 CONT Senena was born in 1201 in Angelsey, Wales.2   She died at the age of 61 in 1262.2 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT
2 CONT   Prince of Wales Llewelyn ap Gruffydd
2 CONT
2 CONT Llewelyn was born in 1228 in Nefyn, North Wales.2   He died as a war casualty, Battle of Builty, at the age of 54 on December 11th, 1282 in Builty, Wales.2 
