1 NAME Sir Edmund Butler, Earl of Carrick, Justiciar of Ireland
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1270
2 PLAC Kilkenny, Ireland
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE 13 SEP 1321
2 ADDR
3 CITY London
