1 NAME Norino /de Leslie/ 4th Laird of Leslie
2 GIVN Norino
2 SURN de Leslie
2 NSFX 4th Laird of Leslie
2 _MARNM de Leslie
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1210
