2 CONT
2 CONT '''Ewen Macdougall''', 3rd of Dunollie and of Lorn 
2 CONT * Son of Duncan Macdougall, 2nd of Dunollie and of Lorn.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was living in 1249.
2 CONT
2 CONT Circa 1250 the keep of Lorn was built in romanesque style.
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1255 he was taken under the protection of King Henry III of England.
2 CONT
