2 CONC eech and his brother Duncan, the father of John who was king afterwards…the sons of Dungal, Somerled’s son"[1046].  Malcolm IV King of Scotland with "Uhtred filio Fergi et Gilebto fratris eius et Rad filio Dunegal et Duuenaldo fra
2 CONC tris eius" confirmed the donation of "terra de Dunroden" to Holyrood abbey by undated charter[1047]. 
