2 CONC ni.com/people/William-Fitz-Warin/6000000016678649311?from_flash=1&fsession_id=1603783053528&through=6000000006804155423 WILLIAM FitzWarin], son of --- (-before 1 Dec 1299, bur London, Grey Friars Church).  His relationship, if any
2 CONC , to the FitzWarin family who is shown in UNTITLED ENGLISH NOBILITY has not yet been established.  The deaths of “dñs Willm Fizwarryn Baro et Isabella ux sua quoda Regina Man” are recorded in Grey Friars Church, London[1057]. 
