2 CONC yn Lord of Badenoch] & his first wife [https://www.geni.com/people/Eve-N-N/6000000023330330063?from_flash=1&fsession_id=1603785802392&through=6000000005597656201 Eva] ---.  Andrew Wyntoun’s Cronykil records that "the Red Cwmyn" ha
