2 CONT m [https://www.geni.com/people/Fionnghuala-of-Moray-Lady-of-the-Isles/6000000001745043413?through=6000000001745043401 FONIE], daughter of ---.  "Reginaldus filius Sumerled dominus de Inchegal…et uxor mea Fonie" donated cows and ot
2 CONC her revenue to Paisley monastery by undated charter[1361]. 
