2 CONT Angus Mor ("The Elder") MacDonald, Lord of Isla; became a vassal of
2 CONT the Sc ottish Crown by the 1266 treaty between Magnus IV King of
2 CONT Norway and Alexa nder III King of Scots that ended Manx independency
2 CONT and brought the islan ds off Scotland's west coast under nominal
2 CONT suzerainty of the Scottish Crow n; supported Robert Bruce(2nd cousin
2 CONT of Alexander III and the latter's or al nominee for the succession)in
2 CONT his claim to the Scottish throne 1291-2 a nd died c1296, leaving Angus
2 CONT alongwith an elder son (Alexander of the Isl es who accepted the
2 CONT office of Admiral of the Western Isles from the Engli sh Crown,
2 CONT opposed Robert I The Bruce, hence he (Alexander) and his seven s ons
2 CONT were expelled from Scotland, after which theirwhereabouts and very exi
2 CONT stence becomes uncertain).  [Burke's Peerage]
