2 CONT a)         WALTER de Lacy (-[15 May 1238/1241]).  The Chronicle of Tintern Abbey, Monmouthshire names "Walterus de Lacy" as the son "Gilberto de Lacy" and his wife, adding that he died young[896].  His paternal grandfather recogni
2 CONC sed Walter as his heir 15 May 1238[897]. 
