1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *''''''Joan FitzJohn1,2,3
2 CONT *''''''F, #10569, d. 4 April 1303
2 CONT *Father      Sir John FitzGeoffrey, Sheriff of Yorkshire, Justice of Ireland2,4 b. c 1205, d. 23 Nov 1258
2 CONT *Mother      Isabel Bigod2,4 b. c 1210
2 CONT *''''''     Joan FitzJohn married Theobald le Boteler (Butler), son of Theobald le Boteler and Margery de Burgh, circa 1268; They had 8 sons (Theobald, Sir Edmund, Sir Thomas, John, Richard, Gilbert, Nicholas, & James) and 2 daugh
2 CONC ters (Maud & Joan).2,3 Joan FitzJohn died on 4 April 1303.
2 CONT *''''''Family      Theobald le Boteler (Butler) b. c 1242, d. 26 Sep 1285
2 CONT *Children
2 CONT **Sir Thomas Butler, 1st Lord of Dunboyne+ d. 1329
2 CONT **John Butler
