2 CONT
2 CONT Joan le BIGOD [Parents] 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6 was born 1247 in Thetford, Norfolk, England. She married Sir Philip III de KYME Lord Kyme on 1273 in Kyme, Lincolnshire, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT They had the following children:
