2 CONT >Isobel Warenne was born on 26 September 1253 at of Lewes, Surrey, England.2,3,4 She married Sir John de Baliol, King of Scotland, Seigneur de Bailleul, Hornoy, & Hélicourt, son of Sir John de Baliol, Seigneur de Bailleul, Sheriff
2 CONC  of Cumberland, Nottinghamshire, & Derbyshire, Lord Galloway, Barnard Castle and Dervorguille de Galloway, circa 10 February 1281; They had 1 son (Sir Edward, King of Scotland, Lord Balliol).2,3,4,5 Isobel Warenne died before 23 O
2 CONC ctober 1295.2,3,4
2 CONT
