1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Eleanor de Warenne1 
2 CONT
2 CONT F, #151499, b. circa 1244, d. after 1282
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=21 Aug 2005
2 CONT
2 CONT Consanguinity Index=0.04%
2 CONT
2 CONT      Eleanor de Warenne was born circa 1244 at Surrey, England.2 She was the daughter of Sir John de Warenne, 7th Earl of Surrey and Alice de Lusignan.1 She married Sir Henry de Percy, son of William de Percy, 6th Baron Percy and 
2 CONC Joan de Briwere, on 8 September 1268 at York, Yorkshire, England.1 She died after 1282.1
2 CONT
2 CONT      Eleanor de Warenne was also known as Eleanor Plantagenet.2 From 8 September 1268, her married name became de Percy.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Eleanor de Warenne and Sir Henry de Percy
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir Henry de Percy, 1st Lord Percy+ b. c 25 Mar 1273, d. bt 2 Oct 1314 - 10 Oct 13141
2 CONT
2 CONT Citations
2 CONT
2 CONT [S6] G.E. Cokayne; with Vicary Gibbs, H.A. Doubleday, Geoffrey H. White, Duncan Warrand and Lord Howard de Walden, editors, The Complete Peerage of England, Scotland, Ireland, Great Britain and the United Kingdom, Extant, Extinct 
2 CONC or Dormant, new ed., 13 volumes in 14 (1910-1959; reprint in 6 volumes, Gloucester, U.K.: Alan Sutton Publishing, 2000), volume X, page 456. Hereinafter cited as The Complete Peerage.
2 CONT
2 CONT [S125] Richard Glanville-Brown, online <e-mail address>, Richard Glanville-Brown (RR 2, Milton, Ontario, Canada), downloaded 17 August 2005.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Alice De Warren was born on 1250 to John De Warren, 7th Earl of Surrey and Alice "Le Brun" De Lusignan.  Alice married Henry Percy and had a child:  Henry Percy, 1st Baron Percy of Alnwick.  She passed away in Leconfield, East Yor
2 CONC kshire, England
2 CONT
2 CONT Alice De Warren Percy is my 25th great aunt.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:
2 CONT * 1.  [http://www.warrenfamilyhistory.com/Docs/Our%20Warrens%20in%20England.htm]
2 CONT
2 CONT www.celtic-casimir.com
2 CONT
2 CONT Eleanor PLANTAGENET 	Born: 1250-1258, Alnwick, Northumberland, England
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Information:
2 CONT
2 CONT Eleanor married Sir Henry DE PERCY Lord of Topcliffe, son of Sir William IV DE PERCY 7th Baron Percy, Lord of Topcliffe and Ellen DE BALIOL Heiress of Dalton. (Sir Henry DE PERCY Lord of Topcliffe was born in 1228 in Topcliffe, Th
2 CONC irsk, North Riding Yorkshire, England  and died on 29 Aug 1272 in Sallay, Craven, Yorkshire, England.)
