2 CONT
2 CONT "History of the House of Percy" lists her as Eleanor Plantagenet, but ifyou go back several paternal generations this Eleanor de Warren isdescended from Hamelin Plantagenet, but Hamelin's children mostly tooktheir mother's surname
2 CONC .  Complete Peerage shows her as AlianorePlantagenet, but as the daughter of John de Warren, as I have it.
