2 CONT
2 CONT 2.^ Annette J. Otway-Ruthven, A History of Medieval Ireland, pp.201-202, Google Books, retrieved on 12-11-09
2 CONT
2 CONT 3.^ Joe Power, Normans in Thomond, retrieved 12-11-09
2 CONT
2 CONT 4.^ a b Power, Normans in Thomond
