1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''ROBERT [VI] de Brus''' (Jul 1243-c 4 Apr 1304, bur Abbey of Holm Cultram)1295 as Lord of Annandale
2 CONT
2 CONT s/o ROBERT [V] & Isabel de Clare
2 CONT
2 CONT x (Turnberry Castle 1271) MARGARET Ctss of Carrick suo iure, widow of ADAM de Kilconquhar, d & heiress o NEIL Earl of Carri
2 CONT * 1.         ISABEL Bruce (1272-1358) 
2 CONT * 2.         MARY Bruce ([1273]-before 22 Sep 1323)  
2 CONT * 3.   ROBERT [VII] Bruce (Writtle 11 Jul 1274-Cardross Castle, Dumbartonshire 7 Jun 1329, bur Dunfermline Abbey, Fife) 
2 CONT * 4.         EDWARD Bruce (-killed in battle Dundalk 14 Oct 1318) 
2 CONT * 5.         THOMAS Bruce (-beheaded Carlisle Castle 9 Feb 1307) 
2 CONT * 6.         ALEXANDER Bruce (-beheaded Carlisle Castle 9 Feb 1307) 
