2 CONT
2 CONT xx  (licence 19 Sep 1295, divorced [Oct 1296/May 1299]) MATILDA, widow of PHILIP Burnell, d/o JOHN FitzAlan Lord of Clun and Oswestry &  Isabel de Mortimer (-< [1330]).
2 CONT
