1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ====FMG (''updated 11 Jan 2023'') [https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/AQUITAINE%20NOBILITY.htm#CecileVivonneMJohnBeauchamp Poutou – Central]====
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Cicely De Vivonia
2 CONT *Born: 1257, England
2 CONT *Marriage: John De Beauchamp
2 CONT *Died: 10 Jan 1320-1321, Stoke-Under-Hamden, England, at age 63
2 CONT
2 CONT Cicely married John De Beauchamp, son of Robert De Beauchamp IV and Alice De Mohun. (John De Beauchamp was born before 1249 in Hatch County, Somersetshire, England and died on 24 Oct 1283 in Hatch County, Somersetshire, England.)
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Cicely de Vivonne was the daughter of William de Vivonne and Maud Ferrers.1 She married John Beauchamp, son of Robert Beauchamp and Alice de Mohun.1 She died on 10 January 1320 at Stoke under Hamden.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Cicely de Vivonne and John Beauchamp
2 CONT
