2 CONT #Robert Beauchamp2 b. b 1274, d. a 1432 
2 CONT #Sir John Beauchamp, 1st Lord Beauchamp (of Somerset)+1 b. 25 Jul 1274, d. bt Oct 1336 - Dec 1336 
