2 CONC toriques/personnages/mrovo.pdf
2 CONT * According to Richardson "Royal Ancestry" IV, under MALET, Mabel married Fulk (or Foucald) d'Archiac, seigneur of Archiac in Saintonge. "They had five sons, Aymer, Knt. [seigneur of Archiac], Foucaud, Amaury (or Aimery) [seigneur
2 CONC  of Saint-Germain], Simon [Archbishop of Vienne, Cardinal of Sainte-Prisque], and Guillaume (monk), and one daughter, Anne (wife of Simon de Lezay)."
