1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Sir John de Bohun, Lord of Midhurst===
2 CONT http://histfam.familysearch.org/getperson.php?personID=I2561&tree=PagetHeraldicBaronag
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Notes===
2 CONT
2 CONT * BIRTH: Date Calculated> Age 26 years as of 14 Sep 1273 (father's death date).
2 CONT * KINSHIP: Son and heir.
2 CONT * TITLES: Lord of Midhurst, Ford, Rustlington, and etc. by tenure.
2 CONT * PROPERTY: Had livery of his paternal inheritance, as well as his purparty of the Mareschal property descended to him from his mother, 20 Oct 1273. Also land in Ballymadden, Ireland.
2 CONT * MILITARY: Battles and Wars> Fought in Wales, 1277 and 1283 (Cl.5 Edw.1. m 12d; rot.Wall.11 Edw.1. m 3d).
2 CONT * ASSIGNMENTS: Summoned to the Shrewsbury Council which condemned David, Prince of Wales, 30 Sep 1283 (Rot.Wall.11 Edw.1. m 2d).
2 CONT * DEATH: Date> 28 Sep 1284 (Esch.12 Edw.1. No 25). -=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-
2 CONT
2 CONT 20 October 1273 did homage, and had livery of lands in England of his father, mother. On 3 March 1273/74 had livery of lands of mother in Ireland. Lived at Ford, Sussex, Eng.  Lived at Midhurst, Sussex, Eng. Sealer of Writs for Ki
2 CONC ng Edward
2 CONT =-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-==-=-=-=
