2 CONC  Derby (d.1279) married 2ndly Alianore - not Agnes - daughter of Sir Humphrey de Bohun [d.1265], who was the son and heir apparent of Humphrey, [6th] Earl of Hereford. And that Sir Robert and Alianore were the parents of Sir John 
2 CONC de Ferrers, the first Lord Ferrers of Chartley.
