2 CONT
2 CONT '''Daughter of''' Sir Roger de Mortimer and Maud de Brewes.
2 CONT '''Wife of''' Sir Robert de Vere, son of Sir Robert de Vere and Alice de Sanford. They had one son, Sir Thomas.
