2 CONT ===Joane de Cantilou
2 CONT * AKA Cantilupe, de Cantelowe
2 CONT * Born: about 1242 Calne, Wiltshire, England
2 CONT * Died: before June 1271 in Coventry, Wiltshire, England 
2 CONT * Buried: church of the Grey Friar’s, Coventry, Wiltshire, England
2 CONT * Father: William de Cantilupe born about 1216 Calne, Wiltshire, England or Aston Cantlow, Warwickshire, England died 25 September 1254 Calstone, Wilts, England buried 30 September 1254 Studley Priory, Warwick, England
2 CONT * Mother: Eva Braose born about 1220 Bramber, Sussex, England died before 28 July 1255
2 CONT
2 CONT Siblings:
2 CONT *Millicent de Cantilupe (Cauntelo) born about 1250 Calne, Wiltshire, England died before 7 January 1298/99 Harringworth, Northamptonshire, England
2 CONT *John de Cantilupe born 1247 Monmouthshire, England
2 CONT * Thomas de Cantilupe born about 1260 Aston Cantlow, Warwickshire, England
2 CONT * Juliane de Cantilupe born about 1225? Cantilupe, England
2 CONT * George Cantilupe born 29 March 1252 Abergavenny, Gwent, Wales died 18 October 1273
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse
2 CONT
2 CONT Married about 1261 to Henry de Hastings (b. c 1235, d. c 4 Mar 1269) born about 1225 Bergavenny, Norfolk, England died about 1268 England. Son of Sir Henry de Hastings, King's Steward of the Abbey of Bury St. Edmunds and Ada of Hu
2 CONC ntingdon. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children - two sons and three daughters 
2 CONT
2 CONT # Auda (Ada) Hastings born about 1256 Bergavenny, Norfolk, England.  Married 1) Rhys Mareduc 2) Robert de Champaine
2 CONT # Lora Hastings born about 1258 Bergavenny, Norfolk, England.  Married Thomas le Latimer.
2 CONT # Joan Hastings born about 1260 Bergavenny, Norfolk, England, nun, Prioress of Grace Dieu
2 CONT # John Hastings born 6 May 1262 Allesley, Norfolk, England died 9 March 1312/13 England.  Married 1) Isabel Valence 2) Isabel Despenser 
2 CONT # Edmund Hastings born about 1264 Bergavenny, Norfolk, England.  Married Isabel Russell.  No children.
2 CONT
