2 CONC nct or Dormant, new ed., 13 volumes in 14 (1910-1959; reprint in 6 volumes, Gloucester, U.K.: Alan Sutton Publishing, 2000), volume VII, page 204. Hereinafter cited as The Complete Peerage.
2 CONT     [S6] Cokayne, and others, The Complete Peerage, volume VII, page 205.
