2 CONT Sir John Barry, 2nd Lord Barry1 M, #115781 Last Edited=15 May 2011 Consanguinity Index=0.05%
2 CONT      Sir John Barry, 2nd Lord Barry was the son of David de Barry, 1st Lord Barry and Joan fitz Maurice.1,2 He married Beatrice (?).2 He died, without male issue.2
2 CONT      He succeeded as the 2nd Lord Barry [I., c. 1261] in 1278.1 On 1 July 1283 a distaint was served on him by the Lord Justiciar [Ireland] to compel him to receive a khighthood.1 In 1284 he surrendered Olethan to his brother Davi
2 CONC d.1 In 1285 he surrendered Muscry-Donnegan to his brother David.1 Children of Sir John Barry, 2nd Lord Barry and Beatrice (?)
2 CONT
