2 CONT *'''     Joan de Somery was born circa 1232 at of Ellesmere, Shropshire, England. She married John IV le Strange, Lord Strange of Knockyn, Constable of Montgomery Castle''', son of Sir John III Strange, Lord Strange of Knockyn, Co
2 CONC nstable of Montgormery Castle, Sheriff of Shropshire & Staffordshire, Justiciar of Chester and Lucy Tregoz, '''circa 1253; They had 1 son''' (Sir John, 1st Lord Strange of Knockin) '''& 2 daughters''' (Margaret, wife of Rhys ap Gr
2 CONC iffith ap Ednyfed Vychan, & of Sir Girffith Lloyd; & Hawise, wife of Sir Robert de Felton, Lord Felton).2,3 '''Joan de Somery died in 1282 at of Knockin, Hopton, Kinton, Middle, Ness, & Ruyton, Shropshire, England.3
2 CONT *'''Family     John IV le Strange, Lord Strange of Knockyn, Constable of Montgomery Castle''' b. c 1226, d. c 20 Nov 1275
2 CONT *'''Children	
2 CONT **Hawise le Strange+6,3 d. a 16 May 1303
2 CONT **Lucy Strange+ d. b 1330
2 CONT **Margaret le Strange+3 b. c 1253, d. a 1284
2 CONT **John V le Strange, 1st Lord Strange of Knockyn+3 b. c 1254, d. 8 Aug 1309
2 CONT *Citations
