1 NOTE {geni:about_me} "Euphemia de Ross (died 1386) was the second wife and first Queen consort of Robert II of Scotland, and a member of Clan Ross."
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Euphemia of Ross Leslie, was the Countess of Moray, after  02 May 1355.
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of https://www.geni.com/people/Hugh-4th-Earl-of-Ross/6000000009677455510?through=6000000011232611631 & https://www.geni.com/people/Margaret-Graham-of-Old-Montrose/6000000009677254575?through=6000000011232611631
2 CONT
2 CONT No children by 1st husband https://www.geni.com/people/John-Randolph-3rd-Earl-of-Moray/6000000001923674361?through=6000000011232611631
2 CONT
2 CONT 5 children by 2nd husband, married	2 May 1355  https://www.geni.com/people/Robert-II-King-of-Scots/6000000000174222887?through=6000000011232611631 (his second wife)
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT # David Stewart, 1st Earl of Caithness, Earl of Strathearn
2 CONT # Walter Stewart, 1st Earl of Atholl
2 CONT # Margaret Stewart
2 CONT # Elizabeth Stewart, the younger
2 CONT # Egidia Stewart
2 CONT
