2 CONT Niall Og MacNeil, 6th of Barra, 26th Chief of Clan MacNeil, Born about 1265 Died Aft 1314  
2 CONT
2 CONT son of, Niall, 5th of Barra, 25th Chief of Clan MacNeil,  d. Aft 1263 
