2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Niall Og, the 26th Chief, fought with Robert the Bruce against Edward II at the Battle of Bannockburn in 1314 .
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT and was rewarded with a charter for the Isle of Barra from Robert the Bruce.
2 CONT
