2 CONT 19. Aed O Neill, King of Ailech (d. 1033)
2 CONT 20. Domnall an tOgdhamh, styled King of Tir Eogain
2 CONT 21. Flaithbertach Locha Feadhaidh O Neill, styled King of Tir Eogain
2 CONT 22. Conchobar na Fiodhbhuidhi O Neill, styled King of Tir Eogain
2 CONT 23. Tadhg Glinne O Neill, styled King of Tir Eogain
2 CONT 24. Muircheartach Muighe Line O Neill, styled King of Tir Eogain (d. 1160)
2 CONT 25. Aed In Macaem Toinlesc O Neill, King of Tir Eogain (r. 1166-1177)
2 CONT 26. Aed Meith O Neill, King of Tir Eogain (r. 1196-1230)
2 CONT 27. Domnall Oc O Neill, King of Tir Eogain (r. 1230-1241)
