2 CONT == CHRISTIANA
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Evidence from the Lamont Papers ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''26 September 1290: Commission and Mandate from Pope Nicolas IV to the Bishop of Argyll, to make enquiry and grant a dispensation to Molmore, son of Lagmann, Knight, and Christiana, daughter of Alexander, called "de Ergadia" Kni
2 CONC ght, who intermarried in ignorance that they were connected in the fourth degrees of affinity, to remain in their marriage to contracted. [https://babel.hathitrust.org/cgi/pt?id=mdp.39015025923007&view=1up&seq=29&skin=2021 Lamont 
2 CONC Papers: paper number 6 on page 5, where Calendar of Papal Letters, Volume I, page 518, is cited]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Printed Evidence ==
2 CONT
2 CONT # '''[https://babel.hathitrust.org/cgi/pt?id=mdp.39015025923007&view=1up&seq=15&skin=2021 An Inventory of Lamont Papers (1231-1897). Collected, Edited and Presented to the Scottish Record Society by Sir Norman Lamont of Knockdow, 
2 CONC Baronet, FSA. Scot.(Printed by J. Skinner & Company Ltd., Edinburgh, 1914), 495 pp.]'''
2 CONT
