2 CONT *F, #102090, d. before 1302
2 CONT *Last Edited=20 Jan 2011
2 CONT *Isabella, Lady of Mar was the daughter of Donald, 6th Earl of Mar and Helen ferch Llywelyn.[1] 
2 CONT *She married Robert I Bruce, King of Scotland, son of Sir Robert le Brus, 1st Lord Brus and Margaret, Countess of Carrick, circa 1295.[1] 
2 CONT *She died before 1302.1
2 CONT *Isabella, Lady of Mar gained the title of Lady of Mar.
