1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Hawise de Quincy1 
2 CONT
2 CONT F, #107761, b. circa 1250, d. circa 1295
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=7 Feb 2003
2 CONT
2 CONT      Hawise de Quincy was born circa 1250.1 She was the daughter of Robert de Quincy, Lord of Ware and Helen ap Llywelyn.1 She married Baldwin Wake, Lord of Bourne circa 1268. She died circa 1295.1 She was also reported to have di
2 CONC ed before 27 March 1285.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Her married name became Wake.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Hawise de Quincy and Baldwin Wake, Lord of Bourne
2 CONT
2 CONT John Wake, 1st Baron Wake of Liddell+ d. c 10 Mar 1300
2 CONT
2 CONT Citations
2 CONT
2 CONT [S11] Alison Weir, Britain's Royal Family: A Complete Genealogy (London, U.K.: The Bodley Head, 1999), page 194. Hereinafter cited as Britain's Royal Family.
2 CONT --------------------
