2 CONT     Magna Carta Ancestry 2011 2nd ed. Vol. I p. 318-320 
2 CONT
2 CONT     Richardson, D. (2011). Magna Carta Ancestry: A Study in Colonial and Medieval Families, (2ed, Vol.1, pp.318 #4). Kimball G. Everingham, Ed. Salt Lake City, UT. amazon.com. 
2 CONT
2 CONT     Richardson, D. (2013). Royal Ancestry: A Study in Colonial and Medieval Families, (Vol. 1, pp.532-534). Kimball G. Everingham, Ed. Salt Lake City, UT. amazon.com. 
2 CONT
2 CONT     Lewis, M. (n.d.). "William de Brewes." our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com . Web. (follows Richardson's Magna Carta Ancestry; includes Magna Carta Surety Barons and many of their descendants.) 
