2 CONC  Cyfeiliog|d. 1197|p381.htm#i26768|Gwenllian v. O. G. o Gwynedd||p233.htm#i26771|4th Baron of Caus Robert Corbet Knt.|b. c 1160?\nd. b 17 Oct 1222|p388.htm#i26286|Emma Pantulph|b. c 1160?\nd. 1222|p387.htm#i26772|
2 CONT
