2 CONT
2 CONT      Griffith ap Gwenwynwyn, Prince of Powys-Wenwynwyn was the son of Gwenwynwyn ap Owen Cyfeiliog, Prince of Powys Cyfeiliog and Margaret Corbet of Caus.3 Griffith ap Gwenwynwyn, Prince of Powys-Wenwynwyn married Hawyse Le Strang
2 CONC e, daughter of John Le Strange, Sheriff of Salopshire and Staffordshire and Lucy de Tregoz.1 Griffith ap Gwenwynwyn, Prince of Powys-Wenwynwyn died before 1218.3 He appears to have been dead in 1218.3
