2 CONT *''''''Heraldic visitations of Wales and part of the Marches; between the years 1586 and 1613, under the authority of Clarencieux and Norroy, two kings at arms (1846) Vol. 2
2 CONT *http://archive.org/details/heraldicvisitati02dwnn
2 CONT *http://archive.org/stream/heraldicvisitati02dwnn#page/360/mode/1up
2 CONT **PLWYF RYWABON
2 CONT *Edward Eton sonne to William Eton sonn to John Eton sonn to John Eton sonn to Elis Eton sonn to John Eton son to James Eton sonn to Ievan ap ''''''Madog ap Llewelyn'''''' ap Griffri ap Kadwgan ap Meilir ap Elidr ap Rees Sais &c t
2 CONC o Tydyr Trefor. Vide p. 357.
2 CONT *''''''Madog ap Llewelyn alias Madog Eton = Angharad d'r and heire to David ap Gronwy.
2 CONT *SEE DOCUMENTS OR SOURCES FOR MORE
2 CONT *____________________
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT * Reference:
2 CONT * The Seize Quartiers of the Family of Bryan and Frances Cooke, 1857
2 CONT * Date:	1857
2 CONT * Text:	"... Emrall,=: Agnes, daughter and heir of Sir John Wysham, Knight Banneret, of Gloucester. 
2 CONT * Married Sir Richard Pyvelesdon de Emral de Puleston 
2 CONT * Richard he is the son of Sir Roger e Puleston and Margaret  verch Gruffydd ap Llewelyn
2 CONT  * Puleston of Emrall, Knight,: second son and heir, living 1345, 2d Edward IIL..."
2 CONT * Child of Agnes de Wysham Puleston and Sir Richard Pyvelesdon de Emral de Puleston is Roger Puleston of Emrall, Knight, second son and heir living 1345.
2 CONT * Roger Puleston of Emrall, Knight, married  Gwenhwyfar Llewelwyn, the daughter of Ap Ynyr, Lord of Gelligynan in Llewelwyn.
2 CONT * Child of Roger Puleston of Emrall, Knight and Gwenhwyfar Llewelwyn is ''''''Richard Puleston of Emrall, Esq'''''' = Lleuki,temp Richard ll, married daughter of Madoc Voel, Lord of Eglwysegle. They are descended from Cynric Efell
2 CONC .''''''
2 CONT * Child of Richard Puleston of Emrall, Esq and daughter of Madoc Voel is
2 CONT * Robert of Puleston of Emrall, Esq son and heir, was slain 1st Henry IV, living AD 1399. =  Lowrie, Married the daughter of Griffth Vychan, of Rhuddalt and Lord glynwrdwt. She is a sister of Owen Glyndwr.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT See Lloyd, "The History of the Lords Marcher," 1884, Whiting and Co. vol IV, p. 104. His information is taken from Harley MS 4181.
