2 CONT *'''M, #146460, b. circa 1210, d. 1280
2 CONT *'''     Maredudd ap Griffith, Lord of Tsanymddyfry Castle was born circa 1210 at of Cyfoeth Meredydd, Gwynllwg, Monmouthshire, Wales, England.1 He married Gwenllian ferch Hywel, daughter of Hywel "Caerllion" ap Iorwerth and Gwerf
2 CONC ul ferch Owain "Cyfeiliog", circa 1235 at England.1 Maredudd ap Griffith, Lord of Tsanymddyfry Castle died in 1280.1
