2 CONT *Pg.13
2 CONT *   VIII. LLEWELYN ap IVOR of Tredegar, Lord of St Clear, married Angharad, daughter of Sir Morgan ap '''Meredith, from the Welsh Lords of Caerleon, ap Griffith ap Meredith ap Rhys''', who bore "Argent a lion rampant sable." Sir M
2 CONC organ died 1332, when Angharad was aged 32. They had : 1. Morgan. 2. Ivor Hael, whence MORGAN OF GWERN-Y-CLEPPA. 3. Philip, whence LEWIS OF ST. PIERRE.  __________________________________
