2 CONT Please see Darrell Wolcott: Maredudd Gethin ap Lord Rhys; http://www.ancientwalesstudies.org/id213.html. Son of Meurig Goch, descended from Aeddan ap Seisyll, of Abergavenny. An expected DOB for Meurig Goch would be c. 1210, not c
2 CONC .1185 of Meurig ap Maredudd cited in Geni. That antecedent line appears to be in error. There is a profile for a c. 1185 Meurig ap Aeddan ap Seisyll, who would fit nicely as a father for Meurig Goch, but at this time that is only 
2 CONC a speculation. (Steven Ferry, September 17, 2020.)
