1 NOTE {geni:about_me} REYNOLD DE GREY, Knt., 4th Lord Grey of Wilton, son and heir, born 1 Nov. 1311. He married before 10 Jan. 1327/8 MAUD BOTETOURT. They had one son, Henry, Knt. [5th Lord Grey of Wilton], and one daughter, Agnes. SIR
2 CONC  REYNOLD DE GREY, 4th Lord Grey of Wilton, died at Shirland, Derbyshire 14 Sept. 1391. His widow, Maud, died at Shirland, Derbyshire 14 Sept. 1391. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Citations 
2 CONT *Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. IV, p. 343. [https://books.google.com/books?id=8JcbV309c5UC&lpg=RA3-PA343&ots=kwmCNZLO52&dq=Ralph%20de%20la%20Rochelle&pg=RA3-PA343#v=onepage&q&f=true GoogleBooks]
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Sir Reginald de Grey, 4th Baron Grey===
