2 CONC ew) 10.  Agnes de Grey, married in 1361 Robert de Clifton, Knt., of Clifton, Nottinghamshire, son and heir apparent of Gervase de Clifton, Knt., of Clifton, Nottinghamshire, by his 1st wife, Margaret, daughter of Robert Pierpoint.
2 CONC   They had one son, John, Knt.  Sir Robert de Clifton died 16 Oct. 1376.
