2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Clare-638
2 CONT https://gw.geneanet.org/snowmedic?lang=en&n=de+clare&oc=1&p=lady+margaret
2 CONT http://knight-france.com/geneal/names/1686.htm
2 CONT https://www.allabouthistory.co.uk/History/Normandy/Person/Margaret-Clare-Baroness-Badlesmere-1287-1333.html?HqwPkwpT
