2 CONT >'''Joan de Multon''' was born circa 1304; Age 30 in 1334.3,5 She married Sir Robert FitzWalter, 2nd Lord FitzWalter, Baron of Little Dunmow, son of Sir Robert FitzWalter, 1st Lord FitzWalter, Baron of Little Dunmow, Constable of 
2 CONC Bere & Hadleigh Castle, Justice of Essex and Alianore de Ferrers, circa 1314; They had 1 son (Sir John, 2nd Lord FitzWalter).3,4,5,6 Joan de Multon died on 16 June 1363; Buried at Dunmow Priory, Essex.2,3,5
