2 CONC  1327; They had 2 sons''' (Sir John; & Robert) '''& 2 alleged daughters.2,3 Elizabeth de Multon married Sir Walter de Birmingham, Justiciar of Ireland''', son of Sir William of Bermingham, '''circa November 1334; They had 1 son'''
