1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ====FMG: English Lords [https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/ENGLISHNOBILITYMEDIEVAL3L-O.htm#JohnMultonMJoanGavaston L–O]
2 CONT * a) '''THOMAS de Multon''' (-24 Jul 1287)....m '''EMOINE Le Botiller,''' daughter of JOHN Le Botiller of Ireland & his wife --- ([Sep 1284/Jul 1287])....'''Thomas & his wife had children:'''
2 CONT ** (c) JOHN de Multon (Oct 1308-[19 Jul 1333/23 Nov 1334]). '''Betrothed''' (25 May 1317) to [https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/ENGLISH%20NOBILITY%20MEDIEVAL1.htm#JoanGavastonMJohnMulto'''n JOAN de Gavaston'''], daughter of PIERS d
2 CONC e Gavaston Earl of Cornwall & his wife Margaret de Clare ([1310]–Amesbury Priory 14 Jan 1325). The marriage contract between “monsieur Thomas de Multon Seignur de Egremond...Johan einez filz et heir le dit monsieur Thomas” and “Jo
2 CONC hane la feile monsieur Piers de Gavaston jadys counte de Cornwall” is dated 25 May 1317 and provides for the marriage “si tost come les ditz enfauntz venuz a age convenable”[767]. ''The Complete Peerage'' states that '''Joan died 
2 CONC “aged 15''' in Amesbury Priory 14 Jan 1325”[768]. 
2 CONT ** '''m''' as her first husband, '''ALICE''', daughter of --- (-before 25 Oct 1339). She married secondly (before Jul 1338) [https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/ENGLISH%20NOBILITY%20MEDIEVAL2.htm#EdmundUffordMAlice '''Edmund de Uffor
2 CONC d'']'.
2 CONT <nowiki>———————————————————————————————————————————</nowiki>
2 CONT '''Our Royal, Noble, Titled and Commoner Ancestors and Cousins [https://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p1472.htm#i44216 Sir John de Multon, 2nd Lord Multon]'''1,2,3,4
2 CONT Father: Sir Thomas de Multon, 1st Lord Multon of Egremont1,5,3,6 b. 21 Feb 1276, d. c 8 Feb 1322
2 CONT Mother: Eleanor de Burgh5,3,6 b. c 1283, d. a 1327
2 CONT >Sir John de Multon, 2nd Lord Multon was born in October 1308.7,2,4 A contract for the marriage of Sir John de Multon, 2nd Lord Multon and Joan de Gaveston was signed on 26 May 1317; No issue.2,3,4 Sir John de Multon, 2nd Lord Mul
2 CONC ton married Alice before 1334; No issue.1,2,4 Sir John de Multon, 2nd Lord Multon died circa 23 November 1334; d.s.p.8,4
2 CONT Family 1: Joan de Gaveston b. c 1310, d. 14 Jan 1325
