1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Our Royal, Noble, Titled and Commoner Ancestors and Cousins [https://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p1492.htm#i44809 Margaret de Multon]'''1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8,9
2 CONT '''F,''' #44809, b. circa 1310, d. between September 1341 and 28 July 1343
2 CONT '''Father:''' Sir Robert FitzWalter, 1st Lord FitzWalter, Baron of Little Dunmow, Constable of Bere & Hadleigh Castle, Justice of Essex9,10,11 b. 1247, d. 18 Jan 1326
2 CONT '''Mother:''' Alianore de Ferrers9,10,11 b. c 1273, d. bt Sep 1303 - 10 May 1308
2 CONT >'''Sir Robert FitzWalter''', 2nd Lord FitzWalter, Baron of Little Dunmow was born circa 1301 at of Woodham Walter, Burnham, Henham, Roydon, Ulting, Wimbish, & Tey, Essex, England; Age 25 in 1326.2,7 A contract for the marriage of
2 CONC  Sir Robert FitzWalter, 2nd Lord FitzWalter, Baron of Little Dunmow and Joan Botetourt was signed on 18 March 1305; No issue.2,3,6,7 Sir Robert FitzWalter, 2nd Lord FitzWalter, Baron of Little Dunmow married Joan de Multon, daught
2 CONC er of Sir Thomas de Multon, 1st Lord Multon of Egremont and Eleanor de Burgh, circa 1314; They had 1 son (Sir John, 2nd Lord FitzWalter).3,4,7,8 Sir Robert FitzWalter, 2nd Lord FitzWalter, Baron of Little Dunmow died on 6 May 1328
2 CONC .3,7
2 CONT '''Family 1:''' Joan Botetourt b. c 1300, d. b 1314
2 CONT '''Family 2:''' Joan de Multon b. c 1304, d. 16 Jun 1363
2 CONT '''Children'''
2 CONT 1. Sir John FitzWalter, 2nd Lord FitzWalter, Baron of Little Dunmow+2,3,7 b. c 1315, d. 18 Oct 1361
2 CONT 2. Isabel FitzWalter+12,13 b. c 1322, d. a 1366
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Citations'''
2 CONT 1. The Complete Peerage, by Cokayne, Vol. V, p. 475; Some Early English Pedigrees, by Vernon M. Norr, p. 69; Wallop Family, p. 330.
2 CONT 2. Douglas Richardson, Plantagenet Ancestry, p. 327-328.
2 CONT 3. Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. II, p. 209-210.
2 CONT 4. Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. II, p. 350.
2 CONT 5. Douglas Richardson, Plantagenet Ancestry: 2nd Edition, Vol. I, p. 341.
2 CONT 6. Douglas Richardson, Royal Ancestry, Vol. I, p. 455.
2 CONT 7. Douglas Richardson, Royal Ancestry, Vol. II, p. 654.
2 CONT 8. Douglas Richardson, Royal Ancestry, Vol. III, p. 218.
2 CONT 9. Douglas Richardson, Plantagenet Ancestry, p. 327.
2 CONT 10. Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. II, p. 206-208.
2 CONT 11. Douglas Richardson, Royal Ancestry, Vol. II, p. 650-652.
2 CONT 12. Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. I, p. 82-83.
