2 CONT
2 CONT ====FMG: English Lords [https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/ENGLISHNOBILITYMEDIEVAL3L-O.htm#MargaretMultondied1341 L–O]
2 CONT * i) '''THOMAS de Multon''' (21 Feb 1276-[May 1321/8 Feb 1322]). A writ dated 22 Aug "15 Edw I", after the death of "Thomas de Multon the younger", names "Thomas his son aged 11 on Thursday in the first week of Lent in the same ye
2 CONC ar is his next heir"[766]. He was summoned to Parliament in 1299 whereby he is held to have become Lord Multon of Egremont. '''m''' (St Peter’s Priory, Ipswich 3 Jan 1297) '''ELEANOR de Burgh''', daughter of RICHARD de Burgh Earl 
2 CONC of Ulster & his wife Margaret de Burgh of Lanvalley. 
2 CONT * '''Thomas & his wife had four children:...''' 
2 CONT ** (d) '''MARGARET de Multon''' ([1309/10]-after Sep 1341). '''m''' ([Nov 1329]) as his first wife, [https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/ENGLISHNOBILITYMEDIEVAL3L-O.htm#ThomasLucydied1365 '''THOMAS de Lucy'''], son of ANTHONY de Lucy
2 CONC  Lord Lucy & his wife Elizabeth --- (-London 5 Dec 1365). He succeeded as Lord Lucy.
2 CONT
2 CONT * 1. '''THOMAS de Lucy''' (-London 5 Dec 1365). '''Lord Lucy.''' '''m''' firstly ([Nov 1329]) '''MARGARET de Multon''', daughter of THOMAS de Multon of Egremont & his wife —– ([1309/10]-after Sep 1341). '''m''' secondly ([Jul 1343
2 CONC ) [https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/ENGLISHNOBILITYMEDIEVAL3.htm#AgnesBeaumontMThomasLucy '''AGNES de Beaumont'''], daughter of HENRY Beaumont Lord Beaumont & his wife Alice Ctss of Buchan (-after 1359). '''Thomas & his first wife
2 CONC  had children:''' 
2 CONT ** a) '''ANTHONY de Lucy''' ([1340/41]–19 Aug or 16 Sep 1368). '''Lord Lucy.''' '''m''' (pardon for marrying without royal licence 29 Apr 1366) as her second husband, '''JOAN''', widow of [https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/ENGLISHN
2 CONC OBILITYMEDIEVAL3D-K.htm#WilliamGreystokedied1359 WILLIAM de Greystoke Lord Greystoke], daughter of HENRY FitzHenry of Ravensworth & his wife Joan de Fourneux (-Clerkenwell 1 Sep 1403, bur Clerkenwell). An undated roll records that
2 CONC  “Johanna” married “Antonio domino de Lucy, qui infra breve obiit in Terra Sancta”[117]. She married thirdly (before 6 May 1378) Sir Matthew Redman. Anthony & his wife had one child:...
2 CONT ** b) '''REGINALD de Lucy''' (-[1362/65]). '''m''' (early 1347) as her first husband, [https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/ENGLISHNOBILITYMEDIEVAL3L-O.htm#EuphemiaNevilleM1RobertClifford '''EUPHEMIA Neville'''], widow of [https://fmg
2 CONC .ac/Projects/MedLands/ENGLISHNOBILITYMEDIEVAL3.htm#RobertClifforddied1345 ROBERT Clifford Lord Clifford], daughter of RALPH Neville Lord Neville of Raby & his wife Alice de Audley (-[Oct/Nov] 1393). A mid-15th century manuscript n
2 CONC ames "Margaretam, Johannem, Robertum de Neuille militem, Alexandrum archiepiscopum Eboraci, Thomam de Neuille electum de Ely, Willelmum de Neuille militem, Radulfum de Neuille de Condale, Katherinam uxorem domini de Dacre, Alienor
2 CONC am uxorem Galfridi Scrope, Eufemiam de Heslarton" as the children of "Radulfum de Neuille" and his wife "Alesia, filia Hugonis de Audeley"[118]. She married thirdly Sir Walter de Heslarton. 
2 CONT ** c) '''MATILDA de Lucy''' (-18 Dec 1398). '''Baroness Lucy'''. '''m''' firstly as his second wife, [https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/SCOTTISH%20NOBILITY.htm#GilbertUmfrevilleANgusdied1381A '''GILBERT de Umfraville'''] Earl of An
2 CONC gus, son of ROBERT de Umfraville Earl of Angus & his wife Lucy de Kyme ([1310]–6 Jan 1381). '''m''' secondly (15 Dec 1381 or before) as her second husband, [https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/ENGLISH%20NOBILITY%20MEDIEVAL1.htm#Henry
2 CONC Percydied1408B '''HENRY de Percy Earl of Northumberland'''], son of HENRY Percy Lord Percy & his first wife Mary of Lancaster (10 Nov 1341-killed in battle Bramham Moor, near Tadcaster 19 Feb 1408, bur York Minster).
2 CONT
