2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Bruce Webster, “David II (1324–1371)”, Oxford Dictionary of National Biography, 2004.
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. Mary Anne Everett Green, Lives of the Princesses of England from the Norman Conquest, Volume 3 (London: 1851), pp. 104-105.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. Sir Archibald Hamilton Dunbar, Scottish Kings: A Revised Chronology of Scottish History, 1005-1625, With Notices of the Principal Events, Tables of Regnal Years, Pedigrees, Tables, Calendars, etc., David Douglas (Edinburgh: 190
2 CONC 6), pp. 154, 156.
2 CONT
2 CONT 5. Wikipedia, the Free Encyclopedia, “Margaret Drummond, Queen of Scotland”, http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Margaret_Drummond_(Queen), 26 February 2013.
