2 TITL David II, king of Scotland
2 NOTE David II was the elder and only surviving son of Robert I of Scotland and his second wife, Elizabeth de Burgh. He was born on 5 March 1324 at Dunfermline Palace, Fife. His mother died in 1327.In accordance with the Treaty of North
3 CONC ampton's terms, David was married on 17 July 1328 to Joan of the Tower, daughter of Edward II of England and Isabella of France, at Berwick-upon-Tweed. They had no issue.
3 CONT
3 CONT Read more about David II in his profile.
