1 NOTE {geni:about_me} >FMG: [https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/SCOTLAND.htm#RobertIdied1329B Scotland, Kings]:—
2 CONT >"5. JOHN (Oct 1327-young, bur Restennet Priory, Forfarshire).  The primary source which confirms his parentage has not yet been identified." 
2 CONT
2 CONT John Bruce was born around 1325 in Dunfermline, Fife, Scotland
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in infancy, shortly before his father's death
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the second child of Robert the Bruce and his second wife, Elizabeth de Burgh.
2 CONT
2 CONT John Bruce, the son of Robert the Bruce and Elizabeth de Burgh, is buried at Restennet Priory in Restennet, Angus, Scotland. 
