2 CONT This person may not belong in the family group. See the text for details. Biography Father: Angus Mor MacDonald 4th Lord of the Isles b: ABT 1240 in Finlaggan Castle, Island Islay, Scotland Mother: Campbell b: ABT 1255 in Lochow, 
