2 CONT
2 CONT Angus Mackintosh 6th Chief of Clan Chattan b: ABT 1275 in Rothiemurchus near Aviemore, Inverness-shire, Scotland Research notes In several sources, she is called daughter of Angus Mor Macdonald, however, chronologically this is im
2 CONC possible. If she is of the MacDonald's it is likely that she was a sister to Angus Mor.[1][2].
2 CONT
