1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Christina of Garmoran''' also known as '''Christina MacRuari''', '''Christina of Mar''' and ''Christiana of the Isles'' was a 14th-century Scottish noblewoman who was the legitimate child of Ailéan mac Ruaidhrí,
2 CONC  chief of Clann Ruaidhrí. She married Duncan, second son of Domhnall I, Earl of Mar.
2 CONT
