2 CONC onte. Return from Robert Wallerond alias Waleraund to the king, 15 June, reciting writ of certiorari de etate, dated 28 April, 53 Henry III. [1269] [Hereford.] Having seen the said Isabel at Erdesleye and examined her age he judge
2 CONC d that she was of full age. C. Hen. III. File 37. (10.)  28 Jan 1284, Newark Simple protection, for one year, for Isabel late the wife of Roger de Clifford the younger. Calendar of Patent Rolls, Edw. I, vol. 2, p. 111 22 Sep 1290,
