1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT Isabel de Beauchamp, d. by 30 May 1306; m. (1) Sir Patrick de Chaworth, d. by 7 July 1283, Lord of Kempsford, co. Gloucester, and Kidwelley, Cymru, son of Patrick de Chaworth, d. 1258, lord of Kempsford, co. Gloucester, by (1) wif
2 CONC e Haiwise, daughter & heir of Thomas of London, lord of Kidwelly; m. (2) by 1286 Sir Hugh le Despenser, b. 1 Mar 1260/1, hanged 27 Oct 1326, Earl of Winchester, son of Hugh le Despenser and Aline Basset.
2 CONT
