2 CONT
2 CONT a)         MARGHERITA (-1286).  The Chronicon Astense records that "Guilielmus Marchio Montisferrati…Margaritam filiam eius…annorum VII" married "filio Pelavicini" after whose death she married "filio Alfonsi Regis Hispaniæ"[240].
2 CONC   The Chronica Jacobi de Aquis, dated to 1334, records that "Marchio Guliermus" and his wife "filiam regis Angliæ" had a daughter "Margaritam" who married in Spain, a later passage naming her husband "Zoanne figlolo di Alphonso Re
2 CONC  di Spagna"[241].  The Nobiliario of Pedro Conde de Barcelos records that "El Infante D. Juan" married "D. Margarita hija del Marques de Monferrato"[242].  Her parentage and marriage are confirmed by the testament of "Johannes…mar
2 CONC chio Montisferrati", dated 18 Jan 1305, which appoints as his heirs "filios Alaxine sororis sue condam et uxoris Puncelli de filiis Ursi", and failing them "filium Margarite sororis sue condam uxoris Johannis infantis de Yspania d
2 CONC e Castella"[243].  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' firstly --- Pallavicini, son of OBERTO Marchese Pallavicini & his wife ---.  
2 CONT
