1 NAME Gilbert de Clare, 8th Earl of Gloucester
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 10 MAY 1291
2 PLAC Winchcombe Near, Tewkesbury, Gloucester, England
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE 24 JUN 1314
