1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Richard de Vernon was born ABT 1283 in Nether Haddon, Bakewell, Derbyshire, England, and died BEF 3 FEB 1322/23 in Harlaston, Tamworth, Staffordshire, England (dvp). 
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the son of Richard de Vernon and Juliana de Vesci. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Family 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Eleanor de Fiennes in 1st wife, daughter of Giles de /Fiennes/, of Wendover, Sir and Sibyl /Filiol/. She was born ABT 1282 in Pitchcott, Aylesbury, Buckinghamshire, England, and died 1302. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Maud de Camville on AFT 1302 in 2nd wife. daughter of William 2nd Baron de /Camville/, Sir. She was born ABT 1283 in Clifton Campville, Staffordshire, England, and died AFT 1342.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Richard de /Vernon/, of Nether Haddon, Sir and Maud de /Camville/ are:
2 CONT # Isabel de Vernon was born ABT 1310 in Arrow, Alcester, Warwickshire, England, and died AFT 1351 in Clifton Campville, Staffordshire, England.
2 CONT # William de Vernon was born ABT 1313 in Nether Haddon, Bakewell, Derbyshire, England, and died BEF 1346 in Harlaston, Tamworth, Staffordshire, England.
2 CONT
