1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1274
2 ADDR
3 CITY Chewton
3 STAE England
1 DEAT
2 DATE 18 NOV 1322
2 ADDR
3 CITY Broadmayne
3 STAE England
1 OCCU Conservator of Array, Surrey & Sussex
1 TITL Sir
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Please see Darrell Wolcott: The Herbert Family Pedigree; http://www.ancientwalesstudies.org/id40.html. (Steven Ferry, April 21, 2020.)
2 CONT
2 CONT *''''''Magna Carta ancestry: a study in colonial and medieval families By Douglas Richardson, Kimball G. Everingham
2 CONT *http://books.google.com/books?id=wHZcIRMhSEMC&pg=PA442&lpg=PA442&dq=Walter+Rodney+1400&source=bl&ots=2EwaxtZB5J&sig=erORFMUYHOiVYpKY7rsXWlT1d88&hl=en&ei=O_W-TdO6H4i8sAPel5zEBQ&sa=X&oi=book_result&ct=result&resnum=3&ved=0CCIQ6AEwA
2 CONC jgK#v=onepage&q=Rodney&f=false
2 CONT *Pg. 108
2 CONT *''''''   5. PETER FITZ REYNOLDS, Knt., of Chewton, Somerset, Broadmayne, Dorset, West Kington, Wiltshire, etc., younger son by his father's 2nd marriage, born about 1274 (aged 40 in 1314). He married (1st) ELA MARTEL, elder daugh
2 CONC ter and co-heiress of Roger Martel, Knt., of Hinton Martell and Broadmayne, Dorset, Glen Magna, Leicestershire, and Merston, Sussex, by his wife, Joan. She was born about 1273 (aged 7 in 1280). They had one son, Roger Martel. His 
2 CONC wife, Ela, was living in 1304, but dead before 1322. He married (2nd) MAUD ___. SIR PETER FITZ REYNOLD died 18 Nov. 1322. His widow, Maud, married (2nd) Nicholas de Odecombe, Knight of the Shire for Somersetshire. She died 1 Augus
2 CONC t 1349.
2 CONT **   6. ROGER MARTEL, of Chewton, Somerset, son and heir apparent, born say 1295. He adopted his mother's surname. He married before 30 Nov. 1318 JOAN ___. probable daughter of Henry de Lorty, Knt., Lord Lorty, of Curry Rivell, So
2 CONC merset, by his wife, Sibyl. They had one son, Henry, Knt. ROGER FITZ PETER died before 6 Dec. 1322.
2 CONT *_________________
2 CONT *''''''Sir Peter FitzReginald, Lord Chewton1,2
2 CONT *''''''M, b. circa 1274, d. 18 November 1322
2 CONT *Father Sir Reginald FitzPeter, Sheriff of Hampshire, Constable of Winchester Castle3 d. 4 May 1286 
2 CONT *Mother Joan de Vivonne3 b. c 1251, d. 1 Jun 1314 
2 CONT  *    Sir Peter FitzReginald, Lord Chewton was born circa 1274 at of Chewton, Somersetshire, England; Age 40 in 1314.2 He married Ela Martel, daughter of Sir Roger Martel, Lord Hinton Martel and Joan, circa 1294; They had 1 son, R
2 CONC oger Martel.2 Sir Peter FitzReginald, Lord Chewton died on 18 November 1322 at of Broadmayne, Dorsetshire, England.2
2 CONT *''''''Family Ela Martel b. 1273, d. bt 1 May 1306 - 1322 
2 CONT *Child 
2 CONT **◦Roger Martel (FitzPeter)+2 b. c 1295, d. b 6 Dec 1322
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT *1.[S7081] Unknown author, Wallop Family, p. 329; Ancestral Roots of 60 Colonists, p. 230.
2 CONT *2.[S16] Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. I, p. 252.
2 CONT *3.[S16] Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. I, p. 250-251.
2 CONT *http://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p754.htm#i22643
2 CONT *________________ Peter fitz Reginald, Lord of Chewton, was also called fitz Reynold.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Ela Martel, daughter of Sir Roger Martel Knt. and Joan (?), before 1295.
2 CONT
2 CONT Peter was given Chewton by his mother in 1299 in Somersetshire.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was 40 in 1314.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was conservator of array in Surrey and Sussex in 1321.
2 CONT
