2 CONT * KINSHIP: De jure brother and heir to John.
2 CONT * TITLES: Lord of Midhurst by tenure.
2 CONT * RESIDENCE: Of Midhurst, Sussex.
2 CONT * PROPERTY: His father having enfeoffed Anthony Bek, Bishop of Durham, of all his property for life, excepting the Lordship of Ballymadden in Ireland, the Sussex property remained alienated from the Bohun family till the death of 
2 CONC that Prelate, which was subsequent to the decease of the two sons of the grantor (Harl.Chart.46F4).
2 CONT * PROPERTY: Having proved his age, he had livery of his lands in Ireland, 28 Oct 1302 (Cl.30 Edw.1. m 3).
2 CONT * DEATH: Date> Shortly before 1 Jun 1306 (Rot.Fin.34 Edw.1. m 10).
2 CONT
