1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Bardolf-11
2 CONT
2 CONT Margery de Poynings formerly Bardolf
2 CONT Born about 1283 [location unknown]
2 CONT ANCESTORS 
2 CONT Daughter of Hugh Bardolf and Isabel (Aguillon) Bardolf
2 CONT Sister of Thomas Bardolf, William Bardolf and Nicola (Bardolf) Butvilleyne
2 CONT Wife of Michael (Poynings) de Poynings MP — married [date unknown] [location unknown]
2 CONT DESCENDANTS 
2 CONT Mother of Hawise (Poynings) de Wysham, Joan (Poynings) de Tregoz, Thomas Poynings and Margery (Poynings) Dalton
2 CONT Died after 24 Feb 1334 after about age 51 in England
2 CONT Profile manager: Darlene Athey-Hill 
2 CONT Created 12 Sep 2010
2 CONT
2 CONT European Aristocracy
2 CONT Margery Bardolf was a member of the aristocracy in British Isles.
2 CONT Biography
2 CONT Margery Bardolf[1]
2 CONT d. after 24 February 1334
2 CONT Father: Sir Hugh Bardolf, 1st Lord Bardolph, b. c 29 Sep 1259, d. c 20 Sep 1304
2 CONT Mother: Isabel d' Aguillon1,4,3 b. 25 Mar 1258, d. c 28 May 1323
2 CONT Marriage and Children
2 CONT Margery Bardolf married Sir Michael de Poynings, son of Sir Luke de Poynings, Lord Crawley and Hawise, before 8 June 1298. They had 2 sons (Sir Thomas & Michael) & 3 daughters (Joan, wife of Sir Thomas de Tregoz, 2nd Lord Tregoz; 
2 CONC Hawise, wife of John de Reydon, & of Sir John de Wysham; & Margery, wife of Sir Edmund Bacon, of Sir Nicholas de la Beche, & of Sir John de Dalton).
2 CONT
2 CONT Family Sir Michael de Poynings b. c 1270, d. 24 Jun 1314 [1]
2 CONT Children [1]:
2 CONT
2 CONT Michael de Poynings
2 CONT Margery Poynings, d. 20 Mar 1349
2 CONT Joane Poynings, d. a 24 Jun 1352
2 CONT Hawise de Poynings, b. c 1292, d. c 14 Apr 1359
2 CONT Sir Thomas de Poynings, 1st Baron Poynings, b. c 1294, d. 10 Oct 1339
2 CONT Sources
