2 CONT John de Ferrers was born 20 June 1271 in Southoe, Huntingdon, England.  He died September 1312 in Gascony, France. He married Hawise de Muscegros in 1300, the daughter of Robert de Muscegros and Agnes de Ferrers. She was christene
2 CONC d 21 Dec 1276 and died Aft 24 June 1340. 
2 CONT
