1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Eleanor La ZOUCHE
2 CONT * Born: ABT 1273, Harringworth, Northamptonshire, England
2 CONT *Father: Eudo La ZOUCHE
2 CONT *Mother: Millicent De CANTELUPE
2 CONT *Married: John HARCOURT (Sir Knight) ABT 1299
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. William HARCOURT (Sir Knight)
2 CONT
2 CONT ---
2 CONT
2 CONT From the profile https://www.geni.com/people/Eudo-la-Zouche-Lord-of-Cantelou/6000000022351029595
2 CONT
2 CONT Who were his children? Cawley in Medlands, calling him Eon, lists three children: <[http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/ENGLISHNOBILITYMEDIEVAL3T-Z.htm#_Toc21506740 link]>
2 CONT
2 CONT * 1) William la Zouche, Lord of Harringworth
2 CONT * 2) Eve la Zouche, married Maurice de Berkeley Lord Berkeley
2 CONT * 3) Eleanor la Zouche, married John de Harcourt
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT If he had three daughters and two sons, that still leaves one son and one daughter. Those vying for claims to those positions include two Elizabeths (one who married Oliver de Ingham said to have been his daughter by an unnamed fi
2 CONC rst wife, one Elizabeth who married Nicholas Poyntz said to be by wife Milicent), a Lucy who married Thomas de Grene of Boketon, a Roger of Lubbesthorpe, and many others.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/xyz/zouche1.php#linklo
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT *Alan la Ceoche or Coche, later Zouche of North Molton (d 1190) m. Alice de Belmeis (dau of Philip de Belmeis of Tong, Ashby, etc)
2 CONT **1.	William la Touché de Belmeis (dsp 1199) 	m. Bonenee
2 CONT **2.	Roger la Zusche of Petersfield and Maple Durham, Sheriff of Devonshire (d before 14.05.1238) 	m. Margaret (a 1220)
2 CONT *** A.	Sir Alan la Zouche of Ashby (d 10.08.1270) 	m. (before 1242) Elena (Ela) de Quincy (d 1296, dau of Roger de Quincy, 2nd Earl of Winchester)
2 CONT ***  	B.	Eon or Eudes la Zouche (d 1289) 	TCP confirms that, contrary to Dugdale, Eon was brother not son of the Alan of Ashby who died in 1270. Nichols, identified below, shows him as son of Roger (d 1285), son of that Alan.	m. (
2 CONC before 13.12.1273) Milicent de Cantelupe (dau of William de Cantilupe, Lord of Abergavenny)
2 CONT ****  	i.	William la Zouche, 1st Lord of Haryngworth or Harringworth (b 12.1276, d 11/2.03.1351/2) 	m. (before 15.02.1295/6) Maud Lovel (dau of John Lovel, 1st Lord of Tichmersh)
2 CONT **** ii.	Roger de la Zouch of Lubbesthorpe (d 1306) apparently of this generation
2 CONT **** iii.	Eva la Zouche (d 05.12.1314) 	m. (1289) Maurice de Berkeley, 2nd Lord (b 04.1271, d 31.05.1326)
2 CONT ****iv.	Eleanor la Zouche 	m. Sir John de Harcourt of Stanton Harcourt (b 1276, d 1330)
2 CONT **** 	v.	Elizabeth la Zouche 	m. Sir Nicholas Poyntz, 2nd Lord (b c1278, d 1311-2)
2 CONT **** 	vi.	Lucie la Zouche (d 23.10.1326) apparently of this generation 	m. (23.10.1312) Sir Thomas de Grene or Greene of Boughton - NO disproved 
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/hh4aa/harcourt02.php#dau1
2 CONT
2 CONT * (3)	Sir Richard de Harcourt of Stanton Harcourt (d 1293) 	m. Margaret de Beke (dau of Sir John Beke of Eresby)
2 CONT **  	(A)	Sir John de Harcourt of Stanton Harcourt (b 1276, d 1330) 	m1. Eleanor la Zouche (dau of Eudes la Zouche)  	m2. Alice Corbett (dau of Peter Corbett of Caus Castle)
2 CONT *** 	(i)	Sir William de Harcourt of Stanton Harcourt (d 06.06.1349)  	m. Jane Grey (dau of Richard Grey, Lord of Codnor)
2 CONT ***	(ii)	Matilda Harcourt possibly of this generation, of this marriage 	m. Henry Crispe of Stanlake
2 CONT
2 CONT ===References 
2 CONT # https://genealogics.org/getperson.php?personID=I00029016&tree=LEO cites 
2 CONT ##[S00042] Martin, Georges, ~Histoire et Genealogie de la Maison de Harcourt, 1974. 222 
2 CONT ##[S00301] Schwennicke, Detlev (Ed.), ~Europäische Stammtafeln, J.A. Stargardt Verlag, Marburg. 10:13 
2 CONT ##[S01352] ~Burke's Peerage and Baronetage 1938 . 1219 
