1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Eva la Zouche is Queen Elizabeth II's 18th great grandmother.
2 CONT
2 CONT 17. EVE8 LA ZOUCHE (Eudo7, Roger6, Alan5, Geoffrey de PORHOËT4, Eudon I3, Josselin2, Guithenoc1) of Harringworth, 
2 CONT
2 CONT daughter of (11) Eudo7 and (HU-7) Milicent (de CANTELOU) ZOUCHE,
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth date probably c. 1278.
2 CONT
2 CONT  was b/o/r/n MARRIED circa 8 Jan. 1289, died on 5 Dec. 1314 and was buried in Church, Portbury, Somersetshire, England. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married in 1289, (F-9) BARON MAURICE "THE MAGNANIMOUS" BERKELEY[32], son of  Baron Thomas "the Wise" and (NV-18) Joan (de FERRERS), who was born INT April 1271 (APR 1271) in Berkeley, Gloucestershire, England, died on 31 May 1
2 CONC 326 in Wallingford Cast, Oxfordshire, England,
2 CONT
2 CONT  and was buried in St. Augustine's, Bristol, Gloucestershire. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children: See (F-9) Baron Maurice "the Magnanimous" BERKELEY
2 CONT
2 CONT  19. JOYCE8 LA ZOUCHE (William7, Roger6, Alan5, Geoffrey de PORHOËT4, Eudon I3, Josselin2, Guithenoc1), daughter of  William7 ZOUCHE, was born between 1181 and 1273, and was buried on 13 March 1289/90[2].
2 CONT
2 CONT  She married (AAT-1) ROBERT DE MORTIMER, who died on 7 April 1287[2]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Child: See (AAT-1) Robert de MORTIMER
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Eve La ZOUCHE
2 CONT
2 CONT Born: ABT 1281
2 CONT
2 CONT Died: 5 Dec 1314
2 CONT
2 CONT Buried: Portbury Church, Somersetshire, England
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Eudo La ZOUCHE
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother: Millicent De CANTELUPE
2 CONT
2 CONT Married: Maurice "The Magnanamous" BERKELEY (2º B. Berkeley) 1289
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Thomas "The Rich" BERKELEY (3° B. Berkeley)
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Isabel BERKELEY (B. Clifford)
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. Maurice BERKELEY (Sir)
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. Millicent BERKELEY (B. Maltravers)
2 CONT
2 CONT 5. John BERKELEY
2 CONT
2 CONT 6. Peter BERKELEY
2 CONT
2 CONT 7. Eudo BERKELEY
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Eve la Zouche was sister of William la Zouche, Lord Zouche of Haryngworth.
2 CONT
2 CONT Eve la Zouche and her husband Maurice were not over age of 8 in 1289, when they married. 
2 CONT
2 CONT See "My Lines"
2 CONT
2 CONT ( http://homepages.rootsweb.ancestry.com/~cousin/html/p411.htm#i23349 )
2 CONT
2 CONT from Compiler: R. B. Stewart, Evans, GA
2 CONT
2 CONT ( http://homepages.rootsweb.ancestry.com/~cousin/html/index.htm )
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Sir Maurice III de BERKELEY Lord Berkeley was born Apr 1281 in Berkeley, Gloucestershire, England. He died 31 May 1326 in Wallingford, Berkshire, England. Maurice married Eve la ZOUCHE on 1289 in Berkeley, Gloucestershire, England
2 CONC .
2 CONT
2 CONT Eve la ZOUCHE was born 1278 in Harringworth, Northamptonshire, England. She died 6 Dec 1314 in Berkeley, Gloucestershire, England. Eve married Sir Maurice III de BERKELEY Lord Berkeley on 1289 in Berkeley, Gloucestershire, England
2 CONC .
2 CONT
2 CONT They had the following children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT    M i Sir Thomas IV de BERKELEY Lord Berkeley was born 1298 and died 27 Oct 1361. 
2 CONT
2 CONT    F ii Millicent de BERKELEY was born 1300 and died 1322/1330. 
2 CONT
2 CONT    M iii Sir Maurice IV de BERKELEY Knight was born 1302 and died 12 Feb 1347. 
2 CONT
2 CONT    M iv John de BERKELEY was born 1304 in Berkeley, Gloucestershire, England. 
2 CONT
2 CONT    M v Eudes de BERKELEY Canon of Westbury was born 1306 in Berkeley, Gloucestershire, England. 
2 CONT
2 CONT    F vi Isabel de BERKELEY was born 1308 and died 25 Jul 1362. 
2 CONT
2 CONT    M vii Peter de BERKELEY Canon of Lincoln was born 1310 in Berkeley, Gloucestershire, England. He died 1341 in Wells, Gloucestershire, England 
2 CONT
