2 CONT
2 CONT  He and Joan fitz Maurice obtained a marriage license on 27 February 1398/99 by Papal dispensation.1
2 CONT
2 CONT  He died circa 1398.1 He was buried at Ardfert, County Kerry, IrelandG.1
2 CONT
2 CONT      He succeeded as the 5th Baron of Kerry and Lixnaw [I., c. 1295] circa 1378.1
