1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Angus MacIntosh or Angus Mac Farquhard was born in 1268.  He married Eva Daughter of heiress of Gillipatrick, the son of Dugal Dall who was son of GillichattanMor, the founder of Clan Chattan and became Captain or 
2 CONC leader of the Clan Angus and a staunch supporter of Robert Bruce and took par in the famous battle of Bannockburn in 1314.  Angus died in 1345.
2 CONT
2 CONT Scotch-Irish Ancestry. Compiled by Edward A. Claypool a Chicago Genealogist 1897.
2 CONT
