2 CONT *'''M, #3155, b. circa 1275, d. circa 1349
2 CONT *Father      William Mure d. c 1348
2 CONT *Mother     (Miss) Lindsay
2 CONT *'''     Sir Adam Muir Weis, p. 44, says his wife is Joan Cunningham. He married Joan de Cunningham; Paget thinks that his wife was Jannet Mure of Fokeltie.5 Sir Adam Muir was born circa 1275 at of Rowallan, Kilmarnock, Ayrshire, 
2 CONC Scotland. He died circa 1349.
2 CONT *Family      Joan de Cunningham 
2 CONT *Children
