1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Not verified, other sources not found at the moment.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir Lord William Mure of Abercorn was born about 1298, in Scotland, his father, Robert Reginald Mure, was 18 and his mother, Sybilla de Graham Heiress of Dalkeith, was 18. He married Marion Cameron. He died in 1382, in Linlithgow,
2 CONC  West Lothian, Scotland, United Kingdom, at the age of 84, and was buried in Scotland.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://ancestors.familysearch.org/en/LB85-JLT/sybilla-de-graham-heiress-of-dalkeith-1280
