2 CONC John Montgomerie of Eaglesham 1 2 3 Given Name: John Surname: Montgomerie 1 2 3 Suffix: of Eaglesham 1 3 Nickname: John Fourth de Montgomery 2 3 Sex: M Birth: 2 3 ABT 1338 Death: 1 2 3 DEC 1388 Note:
2 CONT
2 CONT John Montgomery, 10th Baron of Eaglesham was the distinguished warrior who captured Henry Percy, called Hotspur, at the Battle of Otterburn in 1388. With Percy's ransom he built the castle of Polnoon as well as acquiring the lands
2 CONC  of Eglinton and Ardrossan through his marriage to Elizabeth of Eglinton.
