1 NOTE {geni:about_me} WARINING - Margaret de Somery, m. John Sutton, daughter of Roger and Agnes IS NOT THE SAME AS
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret de Somery, m. Ralph Cromwell, m. Ralph Bassett, daughter of Roger and Nichole. DIFFERENT Roger's too.
2 CONT
2 CONT Margery de Somery, Baroness Dudley1
2 CONT
2 CONT b. 1290, d. 1384
2 CONT
2 CONT      Margery de Somery, Baroness Dudley was sister and heir of John de Somery.1 She was born in 1290.2 She married John de Sutton, Lord of Dudley Castle, son of Sir Richard de Sutton and Isabel Patrick.2,1 Margery de Somery, Baron
2 CONC ess Dudley died in 1384 at age 94 years.2,1
2 CONT
2 CONT Family
2 CONT
2 CONT 	John de Sutton, Lord of Dudley Castle b. circa 1290, d. between 1327 and 1338
2 CONT
2 CONT Child	
2 CONT
2 CONT     * John de Sutton+ b. c 1304, d. 23 Nov 13592
2 CONT
2 CONT Citations
2 CONT
2 CONT    1. [S1417] My De Sutton ancestors, online http://todmar.net/ancestry/sutton_main.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT    2. [S1388] Tudor Place, online http://www.tudorplace.com.ar/index.htm, Sutton.
2 CONT
2 CONT William, 1st Earl of Douglas1
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Magaret de Somery was born in 1290. She was the daughter of Roger de Somery. She died in 1384 . 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT i. 	Maud de Sutton was born about 1303 and died in 1354 .
2 CONT
2 CONT Maud - m. Ralph JOCELYN, b. 13 Dec 1275
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. 	John de Sutton II was born about 1304 and died on 23 Nov 1359 in Dudley Castle, Stafford, England 
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT The last of the male line of Somery, John Somery, died in 1321 and the castle and estates passed to his sister Margaret and her husband John de Sutton. Subsequently, members of this family often used Dudley as a surname. In 1532 a
2 CONC nother John Sutton (the seventh in the Dynasty named John) inherited the castle but after having money problems was ousted by a relative, John Dudley in 1537. from wiki
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT http://www.tudorplace.com.ar/SUTTON.htm#John De SUTTON1
