2 CONT
2 CONT Shurtleff Genealogy pub 1917, Vol 1 pg 149
2 CONT
2 CONT _________________________________
2 CONT *Links
2 CONT * http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Governors_of_Edinburgh_Castle
2 CONT * http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Peers_1260-1269
2 CONT * http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Walter_de_Huntercombe,_1st_Baron_Huntercombe
