1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Anselm and his wife Margaret had four known children: Edmund, Isabel, Margaret and Catherine. Isabel married John de Punchardon, and she was said to be forty years old when her brother Edmund died in 1311. John de 
2 CONC Punchardon/Pynchard changed his name to BASSETT when his wife became heiress to her father's estate.
2 CONT
