2 CONT *'''  m. Ellin Ince (dau/heir of Richard de Ince of Ince) 
2 CONT **          1. William Gerard of Ince, Lancashire 
2 CONT **            m. Cicely Standish (dau of Lawrence Standish of Standish)
2 CONT ***                    A. Thomas Gerard of Ince 
2 CONT ***                      m. Elizabeth Norres (dau of William Norres of the Speake)
2 CONT ****                              i. William Gerard of Ince 
2 CONT ****                                m. Elizabeth Byron (dau of Sir John Byron (Biron of Biron))
2 CONT *****                                        a. ..... etc.
