1 NAME Christina /Fraser/
2 GIVN Christina
2 SURN Fraser
2 _MARNM Fraser
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 PLAC Scotland
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1292
2 PLAC Scotland
2 ADDR
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===CHRISTINA FRASER===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''According to the Reverend Canon MacLeod of MacLeod, Christina Fraser: "daughter of the Lord of Lovat, and sister of Sir Alexander Fraser, who married Mary, daughter of Robert Bruce, King of Scotland". [https://archive.org/detai
2 CONC ls/macleodsofdunveg00macl/page/34 The MacLeods of Dunvegan: 34] The Stirnet report on the Fraser family suggests that she may be the daughter of Sir Andrew Fraser, younger of Touchfraser. [https://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/britis
2 CONC h/ff/fraser01.php Stirnet: Fraser 01]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT * 1.	John Fraser (dvp) 	m. (by 1243) Alicia de Conigburg (dau of William de Conigburg of Stapilgorton)
2 CONT ** A.	Sir Richard Fraser of Touchfraser (a 1276, 1307)
2 CONT *** i. Sir Andrew Fraser, younger of Touchfraser, Sheriff of Stirling (dvp by 1306) 	m. Beatrix (probably dau of Reginald le Chen of Duffus)
2 CONT **** e.	'''Christina Fraser''' probably of this generation	m. Tormod MacLeod of Harris, Sheriff of Skye and Harris
