1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Mary and Mariota were sisters, the two daughters of Sir Reginald le Cheyne, 4th of Inverugie.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Mariota le Cheyne, heiress of Inverurie, married (1) John Douglas and (2) John Keith. Her sister Mary (also known as Marjory) married Nicholas Sutherland.
2 CONT
2 CONT The Scots Peerage names her "Jean."
2 CONT
2 CONT It looks as though Mary and Mariota have been merged at some stage!? (Fixed May 2016).
