1 CONT Donoch Maol-na-mBo: was King of Leinster for 9 years.[KFH]
1 CONT
1 CONT He married (1) Aife ingen Gilla Patraic, daughter of Gilla Patraic and Echrad Carlusa. He married (2) Mael Maidne ingen Domnaill, daughter of Domnall macFaelain.
1 CONT
1 CONT Notes
1 CONT King of Munster
1 CONT
1 CONT Child of Donnchad na mBó and Aife Patraic is:
1 CONT Diarmait MacMáil na mBó, King of Ireland, died 7 February 1071/72.
1 CONT
1 CONT Child of Donnchad mBó and Mael Domnaill is:
1 CONT + 7 i. Domnall6 Remar macMáel na mBó, died 1041.
1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT ===================================================================
