0 @N6000000001783295540@ NOTE Basic Life Information
1 CONT
1 CONT Lafracoth O'Brien was born 1076 in Munster, Ireland.
1 CONT
1 CONT Marriage and Children
1 CONT
1 CONT She married Arnulph De Montgomery.  They had the following children:
1 CONT
1 CONT Sir Philip de Montgomery was born 1102 in Pembrokeshire, Wales. He died 1177 in Thornton, Scotland.
1 CONT Alice de Montgomery was born 1115.
1 CONT
1 CONT <http://www.juch.org/myancestors/aqwg76.asp#8159>
0 @N6000000004969859431@ NOTE Maria or Marrio Montgomery was sister to Alice Montgomery who married Raymond le gros.
