0 @N6000000003796205015@ NOTE ==================================================================
1 CONT
1 CONT A Grandchild's Heritage URL:  http://www.reach.net/~roanne/macmurrough2.html
1 CONT
1 CONT Generation No. 8
1 CONT
1 CONT Donnchad macMurchada, King of Leinster died 1115[6].
1 CONT Donoch MacMorough: the third son of Murcha; was King of Dublin and the 56th Christian King of Leinster; slain in 1115 by Donal O'Brien and the Danes at Dublin.[KFH]
1 CONT
1 CONT He married Orlaith ingen O'Braenain, daughter of Gilla O'Braenain and Uchdelb O'Gairbita.
1 CONT
1 CONT Notes
1 CONT Acceded: 1098
1 CONT
1 CONT Child of Donnchad macMurchada and Orlaith O'Braenain is:
1 CONT Diarmait macDonnchada MacMurchada, King of Leinster, born 1110; died 1 May 1171 in Ferns.
1 CONT
1 CONT 11. Mael Morda8 O'Domnaill died 1090[7]. He married Luanmaisi ingen Ceile O'Nuallain, daughter of Cele O'Nuallain.
1 CONT
1 CONT Child of Mael O'Domnaill and Luanmaisi O'Nuallain is:
1 CONT + 13 i. Sadb ingen Mael Morda9 O'Domnail.
1 CONT
1 CONT ===================================================================
