1 CONC  Llywelyn the Great eventually united the realm and became known as Llywelyn Fawr and is one of Wales's most famous monarchs. Iorwerth was killed in battle at a place called Pennant Mehangell during the wars deciding the successio
1 CONC n following the death of his father.
