1 CONT ^ Powicke pp. 51-55 
1 CONT ^ Lloyd p. 681 
1 CONT ^ There was provision in Welsh law for the selection of a single edling or heir by the ruler. For a discussion of this see Stephenson pp. 138-141. See Williams pp. 393-413 for details of the struggle for the succession. 
1 CONT ^ Davies p. 249 
1 CONT ^ Pryce pp. 414-5 
1 CONT ^ Davies p. 249 
1 CONT ^ Davies p. 249 
