1 CONC ct or Dormant, new ed. , 13 volumes in 14 (1910-1959; reprint in 6 volumes, Gloucester, U.K.: Alan Sutton Publishing, 2000), volume X, page 456. Hereinafter cited as The Complete Peerage.
