1 CONT REF: Sharon Kay Penman: "The Reckoning":  In March 1271, he was in Viter bo on his way back from Crusade in the Holy land with with Charles de Anj ou King of Naples, Sicily & Jerusalem & Charles's nephew Philippe Ki ng of France. 
1 CONC His cousins Guy & Bran de Montfort & Guy's father in law Ald obrandino Aldobrandeschi Comte de Aguilla were in town to welcome the t wo sovereigns back.  Henry of Almaine had been one of Earl Simon's support ers but who had betray
1 CONC ed his uncle & pledged his allegiance back to the cr own.  While Henry was at Mass in the town, Guy & Bran de Montfort slew h im at the altar as he begged for mercy & drug him out into the street whe re Guy hacked his body into pi
1 CONC eces.  After fleeing to Aldobrandeschi's cas tle in Sovana, the Montfort  lands & titles were forfeit, & they were decl ared outlaw as well as excommunicated by the Pope.[2753682.ged]
1 CONT
