1 CONT Hugh de Ross, 4th Earl of Ross was the son of William, 3rd Earl of Ross <p467.htm> and Euphemia (?) <p467.htm>. He married, firstly, Matilda Bruce, daughter of Robert le Brus, Earl of Carrick <p10776.htm> and Margaret of Carrick, 
1 CONC Countess of Carrick <p10248.htm>, circa 1308.2 He married, secondly, Margaret Graham <p10809.htm>, daughter of Sir David Graham <p468.htm>, before 29 November 1329.3 He married, thirdly, Jean Stewart <p10793.htm>, daughter of Walt
1 CONC er Stewart, 6th High Steward of Scotland <p10210.htm> and Alice Erskine <p10792.htm>.4 He died on 19 July 1333.  He was also known as Hugh Leslie. He gained the title of 4th Earl of Ross.1
1 CONT Children of Hugh de Ross, 4th Earl of Ross and Matilda Bruce:
1 CONT Matilda de Ross d. a 1350 William de Ross, 5th Earl of Ross+ b. b 1323, d. 1372
1 CONT Child of Hugh de Ross, 4th Earl of Ross and Margaret Graham <p10809.htm>:
