0 @N6000000002187771198@ NOTE Sir Colin Campbell of Lochow1 (M)
1 CONT b. before 1254, d. circa 1294, #22054
1 CONT Pedigree
1 CONT Last Edited=14 May 2005
1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT      Sir Colin Campbell of Lochow was born before 1254. He was the son of Sir Gillespic Campbell of Menstrie.1 He died circa 1294 in Ath-dearg of Lorn, Argyllshire, Scotland, killed while fighting Alexander, Lord of Lorne.1 
1 CONT      Sir Colin Campbell of Lochow lived in Lochow, Argyllshire, Scotland.1 
1 CONT
