0 @N6000000000437624854@ NOTE Name Suffix:<NSFX> Prince Of Wales
0 @N6000000001744977297@ NOTE Nephew of Henry III of England and Prince of Gwynedd. In 1241 Dafydd fell out with Henry, who supported the rival claims to Gwynedd of Dafydd's half-brother Gruffydd. The king led an army to North Wales and crushed him, but Dafydd
1 CONC  continued to make war against the English marcher lords. [quoted from Elizabeth Hallam, The Plantagenet Encyclopedia (NY: Crescent Books, 1996) 58.]
