1 CONC Stewart, 6th High Steward of Scotland|b. 1292<BR> Last Edited=6 Oct 2002
1 CONT Walter Stewart, 6th High Steward of Scotland was the son of James Stewart, 5th High Steward of Scotland <p10531.htm> and Cecilia de Dunbar <p10792.htm>.1 He was born in 1292. He married Margorie Bruce, Princess of Scotland, daught
1 CONC er of Robert I Bruce, King of Scotland <p10209.htm> and Isabella, Lady of Mar <p10209.htm>, in 1315. He married Alice Erskine <p10792.htm>, daughter of Sir John Erskine <p10787.htm>.1 He married Isabella Graham <p10793.htm>, daugh
1 CONC ter of Sir John Graham <p10793.htm>.1 He died on 9 April 1327.1 He was also reported to have died on 9 April 1326.  He gained the title of 6th High Steward of Scotland.1
1 CONT Children of Walter Stewart, 6th High Steward of Scotland and Isabella Graham <p10793.htm>:
1 CONT Sir Andrew Stewart <p10793.htm> b. b 1312 Sir John Stewart <p10793.htm>+ b. b 1327 Egidia Stewart <p10793.htm>+ b. b 1327, d. b 1406
1 CONT Child of Walter Stewart, 6th High Steward of Scotland and Margorie Bruce, Princess of Scotland:
