1 CONC onicle’, Dugdale, Monasticon, 6/1, esp. 351 · N. Denholm-Young, ed. and trans., Vita Edwardi secundi (1957) · Ann. mon. · Chronicon Henrici Knighton, vel Cnitthon, monachi Leycestrensis, ed. J. R. Lumby, 2 vols., Rolls Series, 92 
