1 CONC t or Guardian of Scotland 1346-7, succeededDavid II 1370/1; married 1st (papal dispensation 22 Nov 1347)Elizabeth, daughter of Sir Adam Muir of Rowallan; married 2nd (papaldispensation 2 May 1355) Eupheme (died 1387), daughter of 
1 CONC Hugh, 4thEarl of Ross, and widow of John, 3rd Earl of Moray (killed atNeville's Cross 1346), and died 19 April 1390.  [Burke's Peerage]
1 CONT
