1 CONT Lady Jean Stewart+ b. bt 1336 - 1355, d. a 1404
1 CONT Marjorie Stewart+ b. bt 1336 - 1355, d. a 6 May 1417
1 CONT Katherine Stewart b. bt 1336 - 1355
1 CONT Elizabeth Stewart+ b. bt 1336 - 1355
1 CONT Isabella Stewart b. bt 1336 - 1355, d. c 1410
1 CONT Robert III Stewart, King of Scotland+ b. 1337, d. 4 Apr 1406
1 CONT Robert Stewart, 1st Duke of Albany+ b. c 1340, d. 3 Sep 1420
1 CONT Alexander Stewart, 1st Earl of Buchan+ b. c 1343, d. 24 Jul 1394
1 CONT Margaret Stewart+ b. bt 1347 - 1350
1 CONT
