1 CONT John of Burley, Lord of Burley b. bt 1332 - 1390, d. 1425
1 CONT Sir John of Cairdney b. bt 1332 - 1390
1 CONT Alexander Stewart b. bt 1332 - 1390
1 CONT Alexander of Inverlunan b. bt 1332 - 1390
