0 @N6000000001220386325@ NOTE [obby1943.ged]
1 CONT
1 CONT Hanged
1 CONT
1 CONT 2nd Baron Mowbray.  Summoned to Parliament during reign of Edward II.
1 CONT
1 CONT Took part in Scottish Wars of Edward I.  Knighted about 1307 with Prince Edward.
1 CONT
1 CONT Abt 1313 made Governor of the city of York.
1 CONT
1 CONT About 1318 made Governor of Malton and Scarborough Castles.
1 CONT
1 CONT Summoned to Parliament 1307-1321 and was Lord of the Parliament 1319.
1 CONT
1 CONT 1 May 1326, Took possession of baronies of Gower and Bramber upon father-in-laws death.
1 CONT
1 CONT Executed for joining the rebellion of the northern lords against the Despencers.
1 CONT
1 CONT Executed after the Battle of Boroughbridge.
1 CONT
1 CONT Relationship:  1st cousin, 22 times removed.  Common ancestors - Earl Richard de Clare and Co untess Maud de Lacy.
