0 @N6000000000604979113@ NOTE Robert I Bruce, King of Scotland (M) b. 11 July 1274, d. 7 June 1329, #102089d. 7 Jun 1329|p10209.htm#i102089|Robert le Brus, Earl of Carrick|b. Jul 1243d. b 4 Apr 1304|p10776.htm#i107755|Margaret of Carrick, Countess of Carrick|b
