1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT    1. Matilda or Maud (c1310-20July1353; m. Thomas Isaac [b. c1300]) had daughter:
1 CONT
1 CONT          1. Joanna (b. c1377; m. John de Ergardia [b. c1317]) who had daughter:
1 CONT
1 CONT                1. Isobel (c1362-21Dec1439; m. Sir John Stewart)
1 CONT
1 CONT
