1 CONT Gray, Sir Thomas, Scalicronica, trans. H. Maxwell, 1913. 
1 CONT Lanercost Chronicle, trans. H. Maxwell, 1913. 
1 CONT Palgrave, F., ed. Documents and Records Illustrating the History of Scotland, 1837. 
