0 @N6000000000337437219@ NOTE Source #1:  George Edward Cokayne, "The Complete Peerage of England, Scotland, Ireland, Great Britain and the United Kingdom, Extant or Dormant," New Edition, Revised and Much Enlarged, Edited by The Hon. Vicary Gibbs and H. A. Do
1 CONC ubleday (London:  The St. Catherine Press, 1926), Vol V, pp. 305-310
